nd Case diameter 40 mm Case thickness 6 mm Case color Silver Glass material Mineral glass Band material Nylon Band color Black Band thickness 20 mm Warranty 2 years Water resistance 3 ATM","id_right":4894738,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":428884,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Daniel Wellington Classic Man Black Cornwall silver\"@nl-NL silver | 10:35 Horloge boetiek\"@nl-NL","description_right":null,"price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":" Meer informatie Prijs € 159,00 EAN 7350068244780 Merk Daniel Wellington Tijdsaanduiding Analoog Kleur wijzerplaat Zwart Geslacht Heren Materiaal kast Edel staal Vorm kast Rond Diameter kast 40 mm Dikte kast 6 mm Kleur kast Silver Materiaal Glas Mineraalglas Materiaal Band Nylon Kleur band Zwart Breedte Band 20 mm Garantie 2 jaar Waterdicht 3 ATM"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1,"row":{"pair_id":"15544838#6906740","label":0,"id_left":15544838,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":4968146,"brand_left":"\"Cartier\"","title_left":" \"Cartier Must 21 W10125U2\" W10125U2 Watch | Watchfinder & Co.\"","description_left":"\"\n                            Cartier has been in business ever since Louis-François Cartier took over the Paris workshop of his mentor Adolphe Picard in 1847. Since then, the name Cartier has become synonymous with quality, luxury and grace. Known as one of the foremost purveyors of ultra-elegant jewellery, Cartier has long made superb watches as well—many with excellent mechanical pedigree. The company's glamorous reputation is justified by every model, crafted with a unique and unrivalled stylishness that continues to make it one of the most highly sought brands in the world. The superb Must 21 series is no exception, as seen in this model's stunning oversized bezel an dial patterned with the Cartier logo.\n                            \n                        \", \"This Cartier has undergone a thorough inspection of accuracy, functionality and condition at our Cartier certified service centre to determine the level of reconditioning required to meet our strict standards. It has also been checked against our records to ensure authenticity.\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":" Name Monthly Repayment Total Amount Cost of Credit APR Interest Free Finance (6 Months) £225.63 £1,805.00 £0.00 0% Interest Free Finance (12 Months) £112.81 £1,805.00 £0.00 0% Classic Credit 24 Months 9.9% £62.15 £1,942.85 £137.85 9.9% Classic Credit 36 Months 9.9% £43.35 £2,011.85 £206.85 9.9% Classic Credit 48 Months 9.9% £34.01 £2,083.73 £278.73 9.9%","id_right":6906740,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":15615928,"brand_right":"\"Cartier\"","title_right":" \"Cartier Pasha W31077U2\" W31077U2 Watch | Watchfinder & Co.\"","description_right":"\"This Cartier has undergone a thorough inspection of accuracy, functionality and condition at our Cartier certified service centre to determine the level of reconditioning required to meet our strict standards. It has also been checked against our records to ensure authenticity.\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2,"row":{"pair_id":"17557347#17557392","label":0,"id_left":17557347,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":854223,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Hamilton Seaview Day Date Auto H37565131\" \"Seaview Auto\"","description_left":"\"<p> Metals in Time is known for having a vast selection of stylish luxury timepieces, from the most trusted watch brands. We offer only top quality timepieces and we provide excellent service to go along with it. There is nothing quite as spectacular as owning a finely crafted watch. It makes a sophisticated statement and is as smart as it is practical. We know that watches come with a variety of features and functions and our skilled staff will help you navigate through our inventory to find the best timepiece to fit your needs. </p>\n<p> This H37565131 Hamilton watch is from the attractive Seaview Day Date Auto collection. Hamilton fine timepieces are both functional and stylish. This H37565131 Stainless steel Gents Hamilton timepiece includes a resilient Scratch resistant sapphire crystal for worry-free wear. Whether you are looking  for a stylish or casual  watch, we have just what you want. Shop with assurance knowing Metals in Time is an authorized Hamilton dealer. </p>\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":17557392,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":784305,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Hamilton Maestro Auto Chrono H32766513\" \"Maestro Chrono\"","description_right":"\"<p> Metals in Time of Royal Oak, MI is known for having a vast selection of stylish luxury timepieces, from the most beloved watch brands. We offer only the best timepieces and we provide excellent service to go along with it. There is nothing quite as spectacular as owning a well-made watch. It makes a stunning statement and is as smart as it is practical. We know that watches come with a variety of features and functions and our knowledgeable staff will help you navigate through our inventory to find the exceptional timepiece to suit your needs. </p>\n<p> This H32766513 Hamilton watch is from the exquisite Maestro Auto Chrono collection. Hamilton fine timepieces are both functional and fashionable. This H32766513 Leather Gents Hamilton timepiece includes a resilient Scratch resistant sapphire crystal for worry-free wear. Whether you are searching  for a sophisticated or casual  watch, we have just what you want. Shop with confidence knowing Metals in Time is an authorized Hamilton dealer. </p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3,"row":{"pair_id":"17557475#8072374","label":0,"id_left":17557475,"category_left":"Sports_and_Outdoors","cluster_id_left":1631615,"brand_left":"\"TomTom\"@en","title_left":" \"TomTom Runner 2 Cardio GPS & Heart Rate Watch Black - Large Strap\"@en Strap · TomTom Running ah\"@en","description_left":"\"\n\n24/7 Activity Tracking - Capture your steps, active minutes and calories burnt.\nBuilt-in Heart Rate Monitor - Get accurate heart rate information on your wrist.\nGoal Setting - Challenge yourself to a daily or weekly target. Steps, calories, distance or active time. Set your goal and track your progress.\nMultisport Mode - Train in run, bike, swim, gym and treadmill modes.\nGPS Tracking - Track your speed, pace, distance, time and calories burnt.\nAutomatic Sleep Tracking - Know if you're getting the sleep you need.\n5 Heart Rate Training Zones - Train in 5 different zones to get results faster.\nRace Mode - Select one of your past performances to race against.\nInterval Training - Improve speed and fitness with custom work-rest sessions.\nIndoor Training Mode - Track your performance on the treadmill or in the gym.\n\nSports\n\n\nTreadmill - Tracks heart rate, speed, pace, distance, calories burnt and duration\n\n\nRunning - Tracks heart rate, speed, pace, distance, calories burnt and duration\n\n\nCycling - Tracks heart rate, speed, pace, distance, calories burnt and duration (Cadence - through an optional cadence sensor)\n\n\nIndoor Cycling - Tracks heart rate, calories burnt and duration (Cadence, speed, pace and distance - through an optional cadence sensor)\n\n\nSwimming - Tracks laps, distance, speed, duration, calories burnt and strokes\n\n\nFreestyle - Tracks heart rate, speed, pace, distance, calories burnt and duration\n\n\nGym - Tracks duration, heart rate and calories burnt\n\n\n\nActivity Tracking\n\nActivity Measurements - Steps, active minutes, distance, calories burnt and sleep\nRunning - Tracks heart rate, speed, pace, distance, calories burnt and duration\n\n\nViews - Daily and weekly\n\n\nGoals - Steps, active minutes, distance or calories burnt\nTraining\n\n\nGoals - Time, distance or calories\n\n\nIntervals -Yes\n\n\nLaps - Time / Distance / Manual\n\n\nRace - Past activities, favorites and custom\n\n\nZone - Pace, heart rate or speed\n\n\n\nWeight and Dimensions\n\nBattery lifetime - Activity tracking: up to 3 weeks, GPS: up to 11 hours, GPS + Heart Rate: up to 9 hours\n\n\nDisplay resolution - 144x168\n\n\nDisplay size - 22x25 mm\n\n\nThickness - 13.7 mm\nWeight - 50 g\n\n\nWrist Size - 143-206 mm\nSensors\n\n\nSensors (internal) - Motion sensor (accelerometer + gyro), compass, optical heart rate monitor\n\n\nSensor (wireless) - Bluetooth® Smart\n\n\nAlerts - Beep & Vibrate\n\n\n\nWater Resistance\n\nWaterproofing - 40 m / 130 feet (5 ATM)\n\n\n\n\n\n \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":8072374,"category_right":"not found","cluster_id_right":1532315,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"TomTom Runner 2 Cardio+Music (S) - Noir/Anthracite\"@fr \" Accessoires de running TomTom Noir-Anthracite \"@fr","description_right":null,"price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":4,"row":{"pair_id":"11831468#16430080","label":1,"id_left":11831468,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":2870961,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Maurice Lacroix Les Classiques Watch LC1087-SD501-160\" \"Shop Maurice LC1087-SS001-121-1 Watches | Costello Jewelry Company\"","description_left":"\"<p> At Costello Jewelry Company in Naperville, IL we offer a wide selection of precise watches.We are thrilled to be a Maurice Lacroix retailer. As an authorized retailer, you can be sure that every Maurice Lacroix watch we carry is 100% authentic and backed by a generous warranty.  Maurice Lacroix watches are built for precision and they are loved for their attention to detail. This LC1087-SD501-160 Genuine croco Ladies Maurice Lacroix watch features a Scratch resistant sapphire crystal for worry-free wear. Whether you are looking for a watch that is stylish and sophisticated or casual and sporty we are confident that you’ll find just what you are looking for. </p>\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":16430080,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":2870961,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Maurice Lacroix Les Classiques Watch LC1087-SD501-160\" \"Shop Maurice LC1087-SS001-120-1 Watches | Costello Jewelry Company\"","description_right":"\"<p> At Costello Jewelry Company in Naperville, IL we offer a wide selection of precise watches.We are thrilled to be a Maurice Lacroix retailer. As an authorized retailer, you can be sure that every Maurice Lacroix watch we carry is 100% authentic and backed by a generous warranty.  Maurice Lacroix watches are built for precision and they are loved for their attention to detail. This LC1087-SD501-160 Genuine croco Ladies Maurice Lacroix watch features a Scratch resistant sapphire crystal for worry-free wear. Whether you are looking for a watch that is stylish and sophisticated or casual and sporty we are confident that you’ll find just what you are looking for. </p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":5,"row":{"pair_id":"7442419#14225300","label":0,"id_left":7442419,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":190840,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Junghans Men's Meister Pilot Automatic Chronograph Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (027/3591.00) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"The high demands placed on timekeeping by aviation were first addressed by Junghans in the 1930s, when the company produced on-board clocks for air traffic use.\n\nThese were manufactured in level 7 of the now heritage-listed terrace building, the structure offered optimal lighting conditions for the delicate task of watchmaking. The classic instrument appearance of the cockpit was also reflected in the legendary Bundeswehr chronograph of 1955. The design of the Meister Pilot harks back to this: on the bi-directional rotating bezel the 12 distinctive, concave notches ensure a good grip as well as the unmistakable appearance of the timepiece. The screwed case back features a distinctive element: a specially-designed compass rose, which incorporates the symbolism of classic aviation in the form of an artificial horizon. The riveted leather strap ensures a secure fit on the wrist. The particular construction of the front assembly lends the timepiece an unusual elegance for a pilot watch – and the lightness required for take-off.\"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":14225300,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":59451,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Junghans Men's Meister Chronoscope Automatic Chronograph Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (027/4324.44) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_right":"\"Meister is Junghans' expression of the style of their classic watches, while staying true to the principles of the finest materials and technological improvements. Refined aesthetics, reminiscent of the watches designed by Anton Ziegler for the brand between 1930 and 1960.\n\nInside the watch is an Automatic self winding chronograph J880.2 movement, with 30 minute and 12 hour counters for the chronograph, as well as sub second, and day and date function. This is displayed on a sunray brushed dark grey dial,  with hour and minutes marked clearly and simply. The case is a stainless steel construction featuring exhibition case back, with curved SICRALAN coated hard plexiglass, true to the original, giving it an elegant curvature to the dial. The watch fastens on a 9 link stainless steel bracelet, polished and matte finished for a perfect accompaniment to the case and dial.\"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":6,"row":{"pair_id":"403467#14740210","label":0,"id_left":403467,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":625465,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Mens Nixon The Crew Watch A1186-001 \"Men's Watches | Designer For Men Hut\"","description_left":null,"price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":14740210,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":66696,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Mens Nixon The Brigade Watch A1176-001 \"Men's Watches | Designer For Men Hut\"","description_right":null,"price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":7,"row":{"pair_id":"6599594#15048688","label":1,"id_left":6599594,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":697642,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Alpina Pilot Quartz Chronograph Watch AL-372N4FBS6\" \"Shop Alpina AL-372B4FBS6 | Moyer Fine Jewelers\"","description_left":"\"<p>An elegant timepiece will never fail to express sophistication and style- and this timepiece from Alpina brings you just that. This Gents’ watch can definitely be an awe-striking piece once you lay eyes upon it. With a Polished bezel, this rarity represents thorough craftsmanship. The Stainless steel case that encloses this piece’s mechanism is also evidence of the quality that comes from this stylish item. The contrasting Navy blue dial color adds a bold sense of luxury. Also important to note is the Scratch resistant sapphire crystal that protects the dial. With additional Date, Chronograph, Central 60 second hand, Small second hand complications to spice up this already brillliant timepiece, you’ll surely bring home a winner if you get yourself one of these beauties. The numbers in the face of the dial are in Arabic, Indexes. It is also water resistant for 330 ft (100 meter). </p>\n<p>This watch is just one of the many impressive pieces we have in store for you. Moyer Fine Jewelers is an authorized dealer of Alpina. We are available to clarify any specifications and look forward to hearing from you soon. </p>\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":15048688,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":697642,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Alpina Men's Startimer Pilot Chronograph Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (AL-372N4FBS6) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_right":"\"This men's Alpina Startimer Pilot watch has a black ion-plated steel black ion-plated steel case and is powered by a chronograph quartz movement. It is fastened with a brown leather  strap and has a black dial.  The watch has a date function. \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":8,"row":{"pair_id":"13407150#8503323","label":0,"id_left":13407150,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":549167,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Seiko 5 Automatic 24 Jewels Men's 100m Rubber Sports Watch SRP601K1 \"@en | Dutyfreeislandshop.com\"@en","description_left":"\"\n        Seiko 5 Automatic 24 Jewels Men's 100m Rubber Sports Watch    \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":" Brand Seiko Gender Men Glass Type Mineral Scratch Resistant Case Material Stainless Steel Strap Material Rubber Movement Automatic Self-winding, powered by the motion of the wearer’s wrist. Manufactured In Japan Made Movement Features Hackable & Hand Windable 24 Jewels Calendar (Day & Date Display) 40 Hours Power Reserve Rotating Bezel Luminous Hands and Markers Transparent Case Back Display Analog Dial Color Black Case Width 44mm Case Depth 13mm Weight 127g Water Resistance 100m","id_right":8503323,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":550638,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Seiko Solar Chronograph Alarm 100m Men's Watch SSC431P1 \"@en | Dutyfreeislandshop.com\"@en","description_right":"\"\n        Seiko Solar Chronograph Alarm 100m Men's Watch    \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":" Brand Seiko Gender Men Glass Type Mineral Scratch Resistant Case Material Stainless Steel Strap Material Stainless Steel Movement Solar Powered Manufactured In Japan Made Movement Features 1/5 Second Chronograph (Stopwatch) up to 60 Minutes Calendar (Date Display) 6 Months Power Reserve Alarm Function Tachymeter Used to measure time, distance, and speed. Luminous Hands and Markers Display Analog Dial Color Blue Case Width 43mm Case Depth 12mm Water Resistance 100m"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":9,"row":{"pair_id":"4940524#17041250","label":1,"id_left":4940524,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":756914,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Seiko Automatic Divers Rubber Band SKX007K1 SKX007K Mens Watch\"@en-US Watch - DownUnderWatches\"@en-US","description_left":null,"price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":17041250,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":756914,"brand_right":"\"Seiko\"","title_right":" \"Seiko SKX007K1 watch\"","description_right":"\"            \t                    Class and timeless design together with the perfect quality form the huge reputation of the brand Seiko. If durability and super service appeals to you, you are at the right address with Seiko.This amazing synthetic, trendy men watch Seiko SKX007K1 has a silver colored, black round case. Except for a time display, this watch also has a day and date indication. This model has a this is an automatic watch that recharges through movement and strong mineral crystal. 2 year guarantee on the movement. Comes in luxury brandbox.\n            \t                    \n            \t                        Read more            \t                        Close            \t                        \n    \t                        \" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":10,"row":{"pair_id":"3548145#17557480","label":0,"id_left":3548145,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":251884,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Hamilton Jazzmaster Maestro Auto Chrono Watch H32716839\"","description_left":"\"\n                             A well-crafted watch is more than just practical for telling time, it is also a remarkable piece of fine jewelry. This Gents Hamilton H32716839 watch comes from the skillfully crafted Maestro Auto Chrono collection. It features a precise Automatic (self winding) movement. Some other benefits of this watch are that it is water resistant up to 330 ft (100 meter) and includes a Scratch resistant sapphire crystal. This watch also comes with a generous 2 years international warranty. \n Are you looking for an exceptional gift? This stylish timepiece is a spectacular way to commemorate any occasion. Safa Jewelers is thrilled to be an authorized Hamilton retailer, so you can  all our watches are 100% authentic. These <fine timepieces are designed to last and will be enjoyed for years to come.                         \" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":17557480,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":371437,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Hamilton Jazzmaster Lady Auto Watch H42215111\" H42215151\"","description_right":" it is also a remarkable piece of fine jewelry. This Ladies Hamilton H42215151 watch from the finely crafted American Classic Lady Automatic collection. It features precise (self winding) movement. Some other benefits this are that water resistant up to 150 ft (50 meter) and includes Scratch sapphire crystal. comes with generous 2 years international warranty. Are you looking for an exceptional gift? stylish timepiece spectacular way commemorate any occasion. Safa Jewelers thrilled be authorized retailer \" A trendy more than just practical telling time so can all our watches 100% authentic. These <fine timepieces designed endure will enjoyed come.","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":11,"row":{"pair_id":"2266461#3926511","label":0,"id_left":2266461,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":12500095,"brand_left":"\"Omega\"","title_left":" \"Omega Seamaster 300m 2531.80.00\" 2531.80.00 Watch | Watchfinder & Co.\"","description_left":"\"\n                            For a long time, the watch most closely associated with the legendary James Bond franchise was the Rolex Submariner. That all changed in 1995 with the release of GoldenEye. In this super-successful Bond outing, in which Pierce Brosnan gives an iconic performance as the renowned British spy, the watch seen on Bond's wrist is very clearly an Omega Seamaster. From that day forward, Bond has exclusively worn Omega timepieces, a partnership that has catapulted the brand's already prestigious reputation. A series of dazzling limited editions have appeared through the years—but it all started with this superb model.\n                            \n                        \", \"This Omega has undergone a thorough inspection of accuracy, functionality and condition at our Omega certified service centre to determine the level of reconditioning required to meet our strict standards. It has also been checked against our records to ensure authenticity.\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":3926511,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":806837,"brand_right":"\"Skagen\"@en","title_right":" \"Freja Ladies´ Watch\"@en \"Skagen Freja Watch 358SSSD nur € 119.00\"@en","description_right":null,"price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":12,"row":{"pair_id":"15352336#8115485","label":0,"id_left":15352336,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":279722,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Mens Nixon The Crew Leather Watch A1188-2769 \"Men's Watches | Designer For Men Hut\"","description_left":null,"price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":8115485,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":625465,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Mens Nixon The Crew Watch A1186-001 \"Men's Watches | Designer For Men Hut\"","description_right":null,"price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":13,"row":{"pair_id":"17557475#7265647","label":0,"id_left":17557475,"category_left":"Sports_and_Outdoors","cluster_id_left":1631615,"brand_left":"\"TomTom\"@en","title_left":" \"TomTom Runner 2 Cardio GPS & Heart Rate Watch Black - Large Strap\"@en Strap · TomTom Running ah\"@en","description_left":"\"\n\n24/7 Activity Tracking - Capture your steps, active minutes and calories burnt.\nBuilt-in Heart Rate Monitor - Get accurate heart rate information on your wrist.\nGoal Setting - Challenge yourself to a daily or weekly target. Steps, calories, distance or active time. Set your goal and track your progress.\nMultisport Mode - Train in run, bike, swim, gym and treadmill modes.\nGPS Tracking - Track your speed, pace, distance, time and calories burnt.\nAutomatic Sleep Tracking - Know if you're getting the sleep you need.\n5 Heart Rate Training Zones - Train in 5 different zones to get results faster.\nRace Mode - Select one of your past performances to race against.\nInterval Training - Improve speed and fitness with custom work-rest sessions.\nIndoor Training Mode - Track your performance on the treadmill or in the gym.\n\nSports\n\n\nTreadmill - Tracks heart rate, speed, pace, distance, calories burnt and duration\n\n\nRunning - Tracks heart rate, speed, pace, distance, calories burnt and duration\n\n\nCycling - Tracks heart rate, speed, pace, distance, calories burnt and duration (Cadence - through an optional cadence sensor)\n\n\nIndoor Cycling - Tracks heart rate, calories burnt and duration (Cadence, speed, pace and distance - through an optional cadence sensor)\n\n\nSwimming - Tracks laps, distance, speed, duration, calories burnt and strokes\n\n\nFreestyle - Tracks heart rate, speed, pace, distance, calories burnt and duration\n\n\nGym - Tracks duration, heart rate and calories burnt\n\n\n\nActivity Tracking\n\nActivity Measurements - Steps, active minutes, distance, calories burnt and sleep\nRunning - Tracks heart rate, speed, pace, distance, calories burnt and duration\n\n\nViews - Daily and weekly\n\n\nGoals - Steps, active minutes, distance or calories burnt\nTraining\n\n\nGoals - Time, distance or calories\n\n\nIntervals -Yes\n\n\nLaps - Time / Distance / Manual\n\n\nRace - Past activities, favorites and custom\n\n\nZone - Pace, heart rate or speed\n\n\n\nWeight and Dimensions\n\nBattery lifetime - Activity tracking: up to 3 weeks, GPS: up to 11 hours, GPS + Heart Rate: up to 9 ho