tes marked clearly and simply with very slim batons, and luminous markers at the 4 quarters. The case is a stainless steel construction, with curved SICRALAN coated hard plexiglass, true to the original. The watch fastens on a fine milanese mesh steel bracelet with safety clasp.\"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":15324118,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":142233,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Herren Junghans Max Bill Automatik Uhr 027/4002.44\"@de","description_right":null,"price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":15,"row":{"pair_id":"7974973#2027607","label":0,"id_left":7974973,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":383152,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Tissot Men's PRC200 Chronograph Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (T0554171105700) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"Updated from the original PRC200, the newer version includes a slightly larger case, with more open dial. In terms of function, the watch still has the fantastic 200 metre water resistance, with screw down crown and case back, sapphire crystal, and a Swiss ETA quartz chronograph movement, with 1/10 second precision chronograph, and date. The case is solid stainless steel, with matte and polished finish, and the black dial has the iconic yellow second hand.\"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":2027607,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":451950,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Tissot Men's PRC200 Chronograph Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (T0554171103700) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_right":"\"This gents Tissot Prc200 watch is made from stainless steel and is fitted with a chronograph quartz movement. It is fitted with a silver metal  bracelet and has a silver dial.  The watch also has a date function. \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":16,"row":{"pair_id":"13408327#12901135","label":0,"id_left":13408327