 (GA-100MB-1AER) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_right":"\"This oversized men's Casio G-shock Military Black watch has a stainless steel and resin case and is powered by a chronograph quartz movement. It is fitted with a black rubber strap and has a LCD dial.  The watch has a date function.  Includes alarm function. \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":19,"row":{"pair_id":"2525869#15859155","label":0,"id_left":2525869,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":998132,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Mens Coach Bleecker Slim Watch 14602343 \"Men's Watches | Designer For Men The Hut\"","description_left":null,"price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":15859155,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":11157121,"brand_right":"\"Timex\"","title_right":" \"Timex Men's Ironman 10-Lap Watch\"","description_right":" \"The Timex Men's Ironman 10-Lap Watch features weekday and weekend alarms a 100-hour chronograph.\"","price_right":"\"USD\", \"28.99\"","specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":20,"row":{"pair_id":"16942755#17557347","label":1,"id_left":16942755,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":854223,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Hamilton Jazzmaster Seaview Day Date H37565131\" \"H37565131 Hamilton American Classics Mens Auto Watch - AuthenticWatches.com\"","description_left":"\" \n H37565131  NEW HAMILTON JAZZMASTER SEAVIEW DAY DATE MEN'S WATCH    Usually ships within 3 months  - FREE Overnight Shipping \n- No Sales Tax (Outside California)\n- With Manufacturer Serial Numbers\n- Black Dial \n- Day & Date Calendar \n- \nSelf Winding Automatic Movement\n- 3 Year Warranty\n- Guaranteed Authentic  \n- Certificate of Authenticity\n- Polished with Brushed Steel Case & Bracelet  \n- Scratch Resistant Sapphire Crystal \n- Manufacturer Box & Manual \n-     \n100 Meters / 330 Feet Water Resistant\n- 42mm = 1 5/8\" Case, 7\" Adjustable Bracelet \n- Deployment Buckle \n- Free Bracelet Sizing  \n        Also Known As Model # H-37565131 / 37565131   \" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":17557347,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":854223,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Hamilton Seaview Day Date Auto H37565131\" \"Seaview Auto\"","description_right":"\"<p> Metals in Time is known for having a vast selection of stylish luxury timepieces, from the most trusted watch brands. We offer only top quality timepieces and we provide excellent service to go along with it. There is nothing quite as spectacular as owning a finely crafted watch. It makes a sophisticated statement and is as smart as it is practical. We know that watches come with a variety of features and functions and our skilled staff will help you navigate through our inventory to find the best timepiece to fit your needs. </p>\n<p> This H37565131 Hamilton watch is from the attractive Seaview Day Date Auto collection. Hamilton fine timepieces are both functional and stylish. This H37565131 Stainless steel Gents Hamilton timepiece includes a resilient Scratch resistant sapphire crystal for worry-free wear. Whether you are looking  for a stylish or casual  watch, we have just what you want. Shop with assurance knowing Metals in Time is an authorized Hamilton dealer. </p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":21,"row":{"pair_id":"16890726#8042890","label":1,"id_left":16890726,"category_left":"not found","cluster_id_left":1588634,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"TomTom Runner 2 Cardio+Music DBL/LBL (Large) - Sky Captain Blue/Scuba Blue\"@en \" TomTom Running Accessories Blue \"@en","description_left":"\"\n                                    Listen to music, track your heart rate and capture your steps, active minutes and calories burnt 24/7 with the Runner 2 Cardio + music.Store and listen to over 500 songs on this ultra-slim, lightweight watch with 3GB storage to keep you motivated while you’re on the go. Track your heart rate on your wrist with the built-in heart rate monitor.A goal setting option lets you set your goal and track your progress, so you can keep in control of your work outs, while multisport mode lets you train in run, bike, swim, gym and treadmill modes. GPS is utilised to track your speed, pace, distance in real time and five different heart rate training zones help optimise your training and improve speed and fitness.  Winner of the product of the year ISPO Award 2016/2017 for the Performance category.Features Include:Automatic sleep tracking lets you know how much sleep you're getting each night.Audio performance feedback so you can stay on top of your game.Race mode lets you select one of your past performances to race against.Interval training improves speed and fitness with custom work-rest sessions.Track your performance on the treadmill and in the gym with the indoor training mode.Compatible with a wide range of Bluetooth headphones (available seperately) so you can listen without wires.Wireless syncing to your favourite apps such as TomTom MySports Strava Runkeeper Up Nike+ etc.QuickGPSFix technology finds your location quickly so you can start running sooner.Water resistant to 50m.\n                                \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":8042890,"category_right":"not found","cluster_id_right":1588634,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"TomTom Runner 2 Cardio GPS Watch with Music Large Strap - Blue\"@en Blue | Start Fitness\"@en","description_right":"\"\nThe TomTom Runner 2 Cardio GPS Watch with Music has all the features you would expect from a GPS multisports watch plus a built in heart rate monitor and the capacity to store all your favourite music.\n\"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":" Model Number 1RFM.001.01 Brands TomTom Colour Blue Manufacturer Colour Sky Captain Blue / Scuba Blue Season Autumn 2015, Winter 2015"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":22,"row":{"pair_id":"12575300#10075393","label":0,"id_left":12575300,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":1401382,"brand_left":"\"Tag Heuer\"","title_left":" \"Tag Heuer Carrera CAR2A1Z.FT6044\" CAR2A1Z.FT6044 Watch | Watchfinder & Co.\"","description_left":"\"\n                            In both name and spirit, the Calibre 01 represents the first of what is expected to become a series of modernised upgrades for TAG Heuer timepieces masterminded by legend of the watchmaking world, Jean-Claude Biver. This model sees the familiar and iconic shape of the Carrera enhanced with an avant-garde (and larger) case build and a striking skeletonised dial. The 45mm titanium-carbide coated case is modular in design, constructed entirely in-house. The same goes for the movement (a modified version of the brand's superb Cal. 1887), which together with the skeletonisation and the red highlights creates a hi-tech aesthetic that builds on the watch's historical race car legacy.\n                            \n                        \", \"This Tag Heuer has undergone a thorough inspection of accuracy, functionality and condition at our Tag Heuer certified service centre to determine the level of reconditioning required to meet our strict standards. It has also been checked against our records to ensure authenticity.\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":10075393,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":189515,"brand_right":"\"TAG Heuer\"@en-us","title_right":" \" TAG HEUER CARRERA Calibre 5 Day-Date Automatic Watch 100 M - ∅41 mm WAR201E.FC6292 \"@en-us \"TAG Heuer Carrera 41 | watch price\"@en-us","description_right":"\" Discover the TAG Heuer Carrera Calibre 5 Day-Date Automatic Watch 41 mm WAR201E.FC6292 \"For people who truly value style, a Day-Date model joins the Carrera Calibre 5 range.\".\"@en-us ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":23,"row":{"pair_id":"14649025#3616530","label":0,"id_left":14649025,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":189515,"brand_left":"\"TAG Heuer\"@de","title_left":" \" TAG HEUER CARRERA Calibre 5 Day-Date Automatikuhr 100 M - ∅41 mm WAR201E.FC6292 \"@de \"TAG Heuer Carrera Automatic Watch 41 | watch price\"@de","description_left":"\" Discover the TAG Heuer Carrera Calibre 5 Day-Date Automatic Watch 41 mm WAR201E.FC6292 Die Carrera Calibre 5-Reihe mit einem Modell mit Wochentags- und Datumsfenster – für Menschen, die Stil zu schätzen wissen..\"@de ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":3616530,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":527492,"brand_right":"\"TAG Heuer\"@en-us","title_right":" \" TAG HEUER CARRERA Calibre 8 GMT Automatic Watch 100 M - ∅41 mm WAR5010.BA0723 \"@en-us \"TAG Heuer Carrera 41 | watch price\"@en-us","description_right":"\" Discover the TAG Heuer Carrera Calibre 8 GMT Automatic Watch 41 mm WAR5010.BA0723 The TAG Heuer Carrera Calibre 8 is equipped with the GMT function and a Grande Date to make it perfectly readable..\"@en-us ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":24,"row":{"pair_id":"2051488#15765464","label":1,"id_left":2051488,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":547135,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Automatic T055.430.11.057.00 Tissot PRC 200 Powermatic 80\"@en official catalog Laguardajoiers dealer of in Barcelona\"@en \"Watch T-Sport Automatic 80","description_left":"\" Tissot T-Sport PRC 200 Automatic T055.430.11.057.00 Powermatic 80. Watches Tissot and updated catalog with prices in Laguardajoiers, official distributor in Barcelona. \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":15765464,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":547135,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Tissot PRC 200 Automatic T055.430.11.057.00 Powermatic 80\"@es catálogo oficial Laguardajoiers distribuidor de Tissot en Barcelona\"@es \"Reloj T-Sport 80","description_right":"\"Reloj Tissot T-Sport PRC 200 Automatic T0554301105700 Powermatic 80, relojes Tissot y catálogo actualizado\"@es ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":25,"row":{"pair_id":"7272784#2954191","label":0,"id_left":7272784,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":9006964,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Suunto Ambit 3 Sports with HR - Black\"@en \" Suunto Heart Rate Accessories Black \"@en","description_left":"\"\n                                    Keep track of your heart rate and running performance while you work out with this multisport watch for a personalised experience. Use with the free Suunto Movescount App to plan your workouts and get voice guidance during your workout. You can also adjust the watch on the go and share your experience with others. Features Include:15h battery life with 5-sec GPS accuracy.Speed pace distance and GPS altitude.Route navigation and track back.Compass.Heart rate in swimming.Bike power support (Bluetooth Smart).Multiple sports in one log.Interval workout planner.Interval workouts with voice guidance.Activity based recovery time.Quick recovery and sleep recovery tests (Firstbeat).Movescount training programs on watch.Extended feature set through Suunto Apps.Languages: EN CS DA DE ES FI FR IT JA KO NL NO PL PT RU SV ZH.\n                                \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":2954191,"category_right":"Other_Electronics","cluster_id_right":16064940,"brand_right":"\"TomTom\"@en","title_right":" \"TomTom Runner 3 Cardio + Music GPS Sports Watch Bluetooth Headphones - Black / Green\"@en Green online\"@en","description_right":"\"Run with over 500 songs and your heart rate on your wristFeatures\n\nBuilt-in Heart Rate Monitor: See your heart rate on your wrist with the built-in heart rate monitor. No chest strap needed.*\nGPS Tracking: Time. Distance. Speed. Pace. Routes. Live stats, on the go.\nPlay over 500 songs from your watch: Over 500 Songs of Music Storage (3GB)\nMultisport Modes: Track all your sports. Run. Bike. Swim. Treadmill. Gym. Indoor cycling and more.\nRoute Exploration: Explore new routes and find your way back to the start.\nLong Battery Life: Get up to 11 hours of battery lifetime when tracking yourself with GPS\n24/7 Activity Tracking: Capture your heart rate, steps, active minutes, and calories burned throughout the day.\nRace Mode: Select one of your past performances to race against.\nInterval Training: Improve speed and fitness with custom work-rest sessions.\nPerfect Fit: Select large or small watch straps to ensure the perfect fit for your wrist.\nIndoor Training Mode: Track your performance on the treadmill or in the gym.\nWireless Syncing: Sync your watch wirelessly with your favourite running apps.\nWater Resistant to 40m: Get wet. Dive into the pool and run in all weather conditions.\nCustomisable Straps: Switch watch straps to fit your kit or match your mood.\nSocial sharing: Celebrate your success with friends. Share your workouts online.\nQuickGPS: Get started faster with quicker GPS reception\nUltra-Slim Design: Notice your watch only when you want to\nOne-Button Control: Navigate easily through menus with a single button.\nGoal Setting: Set and track your progress on daily and weekly goals.\nAutomatic Sleep Tracking: Track your sleep patterns and know if you're getting the sleep you need.\n5 Heart Rate Training Zones: Training in 5 different heart rate zones helps to get results faster.\"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":26,"row":{"pair_id":"9607759#2594676","label":0,"id_left":9607759,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":986795,"brand_left":"\"Cartier\"","title_left":" \"Cartier Santos W20098D6\" W20098D6 Watch | Watchfinder & Co.\"","description_left":"\"\n                            It was in 1904 that Louis Cartier gave a watch to his good friend and aviation pioneer Alberto Santos-Dumont that was designed to be worn on the wrist. The Santos watch was the first ever men's wristwatch, originally invented to make it easier to check the time while flying. It was a game-changer in the industry thanks to Santos-Dumont's huge popularity and fame, as well as a very early example of the iconic Art Deco style that would influence fashion and watchmaking for decades. The modern Santos watches maintain the classic hallmarks of the original, including the rounded square case, Roman numerals and fully incorporated lugs. \n                            \n                        \", \"This Cartier has undergone a thorough inspection of accuracy, functionality and condition at our Cartier certified service centre to determine the level of reconditioning required to meet our strict standards. It has also been checked against our records to ensure authenticity.\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":2594676,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":9040309,"brand_right":"\"Omega\"","title_right":" \"Omega Speedmaster Moonwatch 311.30.42.30.01.005\" 311.30.42.30.01.005 Watch | Watchfinder & Co.\"","description_right":"\"This Omega has undergone a thorough inspection of accuracy, functionality and condition at our Omega certified service centre to determine the level of reconditioning required to meet our strict standards. It has also been checked against our records to ensure authenticity.\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":" Name Monthly Repayment Total Amount Cost of Credit APR Interest Free Finance (6 Months) £393.75 £3,150.00 £0.00 0% Interest Free Finance (12 Months) £196.87 £3,150.00 £0.00 0% Classic Credit 24 Months 9.9% £108.46 £3,390.54 £240.54 9.9% Classic Credit 36 Months 9.9% £75.65 £3,510.90 £360.90 9.9% Classic Credit 48 Months 9.9% £59.35 £3,636.30 £486.30 9.9%"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":27,"row":{"pair_id":"9943517#9512537","label":0,"id_left":9943517,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":202373,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Hamilton Men's Khaki Below Zero 1000m Automatic