includes small second hand, day, date, central 60 second hand complications. Its complications will amaze you because of this piece’s technical precision. The numbers on this timepiece are in roman numeral style, adding to this piece’s luxurious feel. The neat round case is 40 mm. The case is expertly crafted of stainless steel, both attention grabbing and structurally stable. The watch’s stainless steel band fits snugly and fashionably over your wrist. This watch's bezel features gorgeous stainless steel that speaks for itself. This bezel is one for the ages and will always be by your side. It encloses the scratch resistant sapphire crystal of the watch. It has a 150 ft (50 meter) water resistance. The true highlight of this piece is the diamonds that are located in the bezel of this watch. </p>\n\n<p>Northeastern Fine Jewelry knows exactly what features watch lovers adore. For more information, call 1-855-795-NEFJ or email at info@nefj.com.</p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":31,"row":{"pair_id":"2814747#7189568","label":1,"id_left":2814747,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":350944,"brand_left":"\"Casio\"@en","title_left":" \"G-Shock Men´s Watch\"@en \"Casio G-Shock Watch GA-800-4AER nur € 129.00\"@en","description_left":null,"price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":" General Target Group: Mens Case housing diameter: 54 mm housing height: 15 mm Shape: Round housing color: Red glass: Mineral crystal Material: Synthetic","id_right":7189568,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":350944,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Mens Casio G-Shock Alarm Chronograph Watch GA-800-4AER \"Sale | The Hut\"","description_right":null,"price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":32,"row":{"pair_id":"2583781#11471430","label":0,"id_left":2583781,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":13867,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Raymond Weil Toccata Watch 5988-ST-00300\" \"Shop Raymond 5988-STP-97081 Watches | Costello Jewelry Company\"","description_left":"\"<p> At Naperville’s most popular jewelry destination we offer a comprehensive selection of luxury watches.We are proud to be a Raymond Weil retailer. As an authorized retailer, you can be sure that every Raymond Weil watch we carry is 100% authentic and backed by a generous warranty.  Raymond Weil watches are crafted for comfort and they are known for their attention to detail. This 5988-ST-00300 Stainless steel Ladies Raymond Weil watch features a Scratch resistant sapphire crystal for worry-free wear. Whether you are looking for a watch that is stylish and sophisticated or casual and sporty we are confident that you’ll find just what you are looking for. </p>\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":11471430,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":396570,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Raymond Weil Noemia Watch 5132-STS-00985\" \"Shop Raymond 5132-ST-00985 Watches | Costello Jewelry Company\"","description_right":"\"<p> At Costello Jewelry Company we offer a vast selection of well-crafted watches.We are proud to be a Raymond Weil retailer. As an authorized retailer, you can be sure that every Raymond Weil watch we carry is 100% authentic and backed by a generous warranty.  Raymond Weil watches are crafted for precision and they are sought after for their attention to detail. This 5132-STS-00985 Stainless steel Ladies Raymond Weil watch features a Scratch resistant sapphire crystal for worry-free wear. Whether you are looking for a watch that is stylish and sophisticated or casual and athletic we are confident that you’ll find just what you are looking for. </p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":33,"row":{"pair_id":"5463413#2551680","label":0,"id_left":5463413,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":477867,"brand_left":"\"Suunto\"@en","title_left":" \"SUUNTO AMBIT 3 PEAK BLACK\"@en BLACK - TREKKING GPS Suunto colour Black SS020677000 Athletic footwear apparel and sports equipment\"@en","description_left":"\"<p>Clock and GPS for Suunto sport model Ambit Peak 3 Black.<br>A GPS clock with advanced features for outdoor and multisport and mobile connection.</p>\n<p>SUUNTO AMBIT3 PEAK: THE ADVENTURE EXPERIENCE<br>The path to the destination is the most important thing – you speak of the mountains or a personal goal. Suunto Ambit3 GPS clock Peak is ideal for sport and adventure. Will guide you at every step, providing you with all the data needed to progress safely in your business. Connect the watch to your iPhone via bluetooth and using Suunto Movescount App to adjust the clock during the activity and to enrich, relive and share your experience. There isn't a better adventure companion to give importance to your every move.</p>\n<p>Main features:</p>\n<p>OUTDOOR AND MULTISPORT<br>-Navigation routes<br>-Operating time max. 50 h with GPS<br>-Compass<br>-Altitude (FusedAltiTM)<br>-Sunrise/sunset<br>-Temperature<br>-Heart rate monitor, swimming (with Suunto Smart Sensor)<br>-Recovery time depending on the activity<br>-Speed, pace and distance<br>-Bike Power Support (Bluetooth Smart)<br>-More sports in a single registration<br>-Training Programs<br>-New functions thanks to Suunto App</p>\n<p>CONNECTIVITY<br>-Upload and share your moves instantaneously (with Suunto Movescount App and Smartphones =<br>-Customize your watch during physical activity (with Suunto Movescount App and Smartphones)<br>-Time and GPS satellite data updated during physical activity (with Suunto Movescount App and Smartphones)<br>-Use your phone as a second display (with Suunto Movescount App and Smartphones)<br>-See your calls, messages, and transfer notifications on the clock (with Suunto Movescount App and Smartphones)</p>\n<p>ENRICH, RELIVE AND SHARE<br>-Take photos during your performance, showing the current speed, distance and other information (with Suunto Movescount App and Smartphones)<br>-Create a video on your Suunto performance with 3D map, key values and images (with Suunto Movescount App and Smartphones)<br>-Share your experience instantly on social networks (with Suunto Movescount App and Smartphones)</p>\n<p>THE DEVICES COMPATIBLE WITH SUUNTO MOVESCOUNT APP ARE:<br>-3° generation iPad and more<br>-iPad iPad Mini/Air<br>-iPhone 4s/iPhone/iPhone 5 5 c/iPhone 5s<br>-5th generation iPod touch</p>\n<p>Dimensions:<br>50x50x18 mm.<br>Weight 89 gr.</p>\n<p>Package contents:<br>-Suunto Ambit3 Peak Black<br>-USB Cable<br>-Quick Guide<br>-Warranty information</p>\"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":" SKU SS020677000 Size S.T. Brand Suunto Product category Trekking Gps Color Black","id_right":2551680,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":8101795,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Custom 3 Birthstone Heart Family Tree Necklace\" Pendant | Eve's Addiction®\"","description_right":"\"Personalize the 3 Birthstone Heart Family Tree Necklace for someone in your life! Featuring a stunning heart shaped family tree charm that can be customized with 3 birthstones, this pendant is ideal for someone who has three children or grandchildren. The family tree heart measures 3/4 inches long and dangles from your choice of 16, 18 or 20 inch rolo chain. The Sterling Silver 3 Heart Birthstone Family tree, along with all of Eve's Addiction's birthstone jewelry can be personalized the same day you order and shipped in 24 hours within an Eve's Addiction gift box.\nDetails: • 3 Birthstones • Heart Family Tree Pendant • Variety of Rolo Chain Lengths Available • .925 Sterling Silver\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":34,"row":{"pair_id":"15092873#13509760","label":0,"id_left":15092873,"category_left":"Cellphones_and_Accessories","cluster_id_left":7598741,"brand_left":"\"Samsung\"@en-US","title_left":" \"Samsung Gear S2 Smartwatch - Silver\"@en-US \"Accessories Page 138 | Roaming Free Sims\"@en-US","description_left":"\"With elegant curves and premium finishes, the Samsung Gear S2 will turn heads. The circular interface and rotating bezel give you effortless navigation, so you can quickly access the things that are most important to you. This intuitive interface lets you easily access important notifications, texts, and updates from your phone with just a glance at your wrist. The built-in S-Health app tracks your steps, your heart rate, and even gives you a nudge when itâ€™s time to get moving. And with built-in wireless charging, itâ€™s easy to keep the Gear S2 powered up. Whether youâ€™re at home, work or anywhere in between, you can power up by simply setting your Gear S2 on the included wireless charging dock. Plus, with easily customizable watch faces, you can customize the Gear S2 to fit your unique style. With powerful capabilities and sleek looks, the Gear S2 will help you get the most out of your day.\"@en-US ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":13509760,"category_right":"Cellphones_and_Accessories","cluster_id_right":16060096,"brand_right":"\"Samsung\"@en-US","title_right":" \"Samsung Gear Fit2 Smartwatch Large, Black\"@en-US \"Accessories - Page 194 | Roaming Free Sims\"@en-US","description_right":"\"When youâ€™re looking for motivation to stay at your best, the Samsung GearFit2 keeps you in the zone. It automatically recognizes whatever youâ€™re doing and starts monitoring steps, distance, Heart rate and more. You can even Map your run with the Accurate Built-in GPS. Receive and responds to notifications from your wrist and turn up the music that gets you moving. We all have goals. The Samsung GearFit2 will help you achieve yours.\"@en-US ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":35,"row":{"pair_id":"5775498#130831","label":0,"id_left":5775498,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":637661,"brand_left":"\"Seiko\"@en","title_left":" \"Prospex Diver´s Revival Automatic Watch\"@en \"Seiko Prospex Watch SRP773K1 nur € 439.00\"@en","description_left":null,"price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":130831,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":12247538,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Carl F Bucherer Peripheral Watch 00.10917.08.73.11\" \"Shop Carl 00.10917.08.83.11 | Moyer Fine Jewelers\"","description_right":"\"<p>An intricate watch will never fail to deliver sophistication and style- and this timepiece from Carl F Bucherer brings you just that. This Gents’ watch can surely be an awe-striking piece once you lay eyes upon it. With a Diamond bezel, this beauty represents thorough craftsmanship. Resting upon the Bezel are dazzling diamond stones that border the watch mesmerizingly. The Stainless steel case that encloses this piece’s mechanism is also proof of the quality that comes from this stylish item. Also important to note is the Scratch resistant sapphire crystal that protects the dial. With additional Small second hand, Date, Central 60 second hand complications to spice up this already brillliant timepiece, you’ll surely bring home a winner if you get yourself one of these beauties. </p>\n<p>This chic and classy watch from Carl F Bucherer has a Pin buckle clasp type and sports a Automatic (self winding) movement. The numbers in the face of the dial are in Indexes. It is also water resistant for 100 ft (30 meter). </p>\n<p>This watch is just one of the many impressive pieces we have in store for you. Moyer Fine Jewelers is an authorized dealer of Carl F Bucherer. We are available to answer your questions and look forward to hearing from you soon. </p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":36,"row":{"pair_id":"7728833#3791455","label":0,"id_left":7728833,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":3469,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Daniel Wellington Men's Glasgow Silver 36mm Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (DW00100047) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"This 