:null,"title_right":" \" Daniel Wellington Men's Dapper 38mm Durham Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (DW00100115) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_right":"\"This gents Daniel Wellington Dapper 38mm Durham watch has a PVD rose plating PVD rose plating case and is powered by a quartz movement. It is fitted with a brown leather  strap and has a off white dial.  The watch has a date function. \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":42,"row":{"pair_id":"17557315#14432843","label":1,"id_left":17557315,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":597042,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Hamilton Jazzmaster Seaview Chrono Quartz Watch H37512131\" \"Shop Hamilton Collection at Safa Jewelers\"","description_left":"\"<p> A luxurious watch is more than just practical for telling time, it is also a incredible piece of fine jewelry. This Gents Hamilton H37512131 watch is from the finely crafted Seaview Chrono Quartz collection. It features a precise Quartz (battery) movement. Some other benefits of this watch are that it is water resistant up to 330 ft (100 meter) and includes a Scratch resistant sapphire crystal. This watch also comes with a generous 2 years international warranty. </p>\n<p> Are you looking for an exceptional gift? This stylish timepiece is a spectacular way to commemorate any occasion. Safa Jewelers is proud to be an authorized Hamilton retailer, so you can exquisite timepieces are built to last and will be loved for years to come. </p>\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":14432843,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":597042,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Herren Hamilton Jazzmaster Seaview Chronograf Uhr H37512131\"@de","description_right":null,"price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":43,"row":{"pair_id":"8447793#9096920","label":0,"id_left":8447793,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":255455,"brand_left":"\"Casio Edifice\"","t