ial Color Black Case Width 42mm Case Depth 13mm Weight - Water Resistance 100m"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":44,"row":{"pair_id":"17557330#17557343","label":0,"id_left":17557330,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":251884,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Hamilton Jazzmaster Maestro Auto Chrono Watch H32716839\" H32766513\"","description_left":" it is also a remarkable piece of fine jewelry. This Gents Hamilton H32766513 watch from the stunning Maestro Auto Chrono collection. It features accurate Automatic (self winding) movement. Some other benefits this are that water resistant up to 330 ft (100 meter) and includes Scratch sapphire crystal. comes with generous 2 years international warranty. Are you looking for an exceptional gift? timepiece way commemorate any occasion. Safa Jewelers proud be authorized retailer \" A luxurious more than just used telling time so can exquisite timepieces designed last will loved come.","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":17557343,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":784305,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Hamilton Jazzmaster Maestro Auto Chrono Watch H32766513\" H32766783\"","description_right":" \" A exquisite watch is more than just useful for telling time it also a incredible piece of fine jewelry. This Gents Hamilton H32766783 comes from the ever popular Maestro Auto Chrono collection. It features accurate Automatic (self winding) movement. Some other benefits this are that water resistant up to 330 ft (100 meter) and includes Scratch sapphire crystal. with generous 2 years international warranty. Are you looking an exceptional gift? stylish timepiece way commemorate any occasion. Safa Jewelers Philadelphia privileged be authorized retailer so can timepieces designed endure will loved come.","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":45,"row":{"pair_id":"17482313#5703753","label":0,"id_left":17482313,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":315882,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Daniel Wellington Ladies' Bristol Rose 36mm Watch\"@en \"Ladies' Watch (DW00100039) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"This slim-line ladies Daniel Wellington Bristol Rose 36mm watch is made from PVD rose plating and is fitted with a quartz movement. It is fitted with a brown leather  strap and has a cream dial. \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":5703753,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":4029,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Daniel Wellington Classic Man St Mawes rose gold\"@en-GB gold 10:35 Watch boutique\"@en-GB","description_right":null,"price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":" More Information Price €189.00 EAN 7350068240065 Brand Daniel Wellington Dial type Analogue Dial color White Gender Men Case material Stainless steel Case shape Round Case diameter 40 mm Case thickness 6 mm Case color Rosé gold Glass material Mineral glass Band material Leather Band color Brown Band thickness 20 mm Warranty 2 years Water resistance 3 ATM"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":46,"row":{"pair_id":"17557405#17557455","label":1,"id_left":17557405,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":15492705,"brand_left":"\"\n                        \n                            DIESEL\n                        \n                    \"@en","title_left":" \"Diesel 'mr. Daddy 2.0' Chronograph Watch \"@en \" Men's Metallic Diesel 'little Daddy' Bracelet","description_left":" \" A heavy-duty industrial-inspired case tops an unmistakable watch set on a sleek steel bracelet. Twin main dials track two different times at once while inset subdials the hours and seconds. Color: metallic \"@en","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":17557455,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":15492705,"brand_right":"\"\n                        \n                            DIESEL\n                        \n                    \"@en","title_right":" \"Diesel 'mr. Daddy 2.0' Chronograph Watch \"@en \" Men's Black Diesel 'rollcage' Exposed","description_right":" \" A knurled topring frames a speedometer-inspired watch featuring brushed dial with exposed hardware and applied indexes. Color: black \"@en","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":47,"row":{"pair_id":"15163031#2345785","label":0,"id_left":15163031,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":58312,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Casio Men's Edifice Time Traveller Bluetooth Hybrid Smartwatch Alarm Chronograph Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (EQB-500D-1AER) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"Mobile Link function (Wireless linking with Bluetooth Smart devices)\nRequires download of the CASIO WATCH+ app to your phone. (Available on the Google Play Store and Apple App Store for compatible devices)\nWorld Time dial at 9 o'clock can be set to one of approximately 300 cities around the globe.\nHome Time and World Time settings (including summer time) updated at a preset time each day.\nUse your phone to adjust hand positions, set alarm times, and more.\nUse your phone to change the distance setting for calculation of speed in the Stopwatch mode.\nTransfer stopwatch data to a phone to create a log file.(lap/split time display measured in 1/1000 second for up to 100 entries)\nPhone finder causes your phone to emit a tone when a watch button is pressed.\nUse your watch to check for new e-mail. (Requires registration of mail account with the app.)\n\nTough Solar\nDual Dial World Time\nDaily Alarm\n100-meter water resistance\nDay indicator\nDate display\"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":2345785,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":412091,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Tissot Men's T-Touch Expert Titanium Alarm Chronograph Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (T0134204720200) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_right":"\"The all-new T-Touch Expert - with chonograph, altimeter, compass, barometer, alarm, thermometer, backlight, 2 alarms, more accurate atmospheric readings, second time zone and is now 100 metres water resistant. Housed in a lightweight titanium case with black rubber strap and deployment clasp.\"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":48,"row":{"pair_id":"17557386#7796268","label":0,"id_left":17557386,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":11213997,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Cartier Santos 100 Watch W20073X8\" \"Shop Cartier WSSA0006 Watches | Northeastern Fine Jewelry\"","description_left":"\"<p>This fine watch, model number W20073X8 from Cartier provides style and top notch functionality for your everyday fashion. This Gents timepiece features some of the most contemporary and useful features. </p>\n\n<p> \nThis is the timepiece of insurmountable functionality and exquisite style. A silver dial provides superior readability. Its automatic (self winding) movement features complications you’ll come to cherish. This watch includes central 60 second hand complications. Its complications greatly increase your watch’s functionality. The numbers on this timepiece are in roman numeral style, adding to this piece’s luxurious feel. The case is artfully crafted of stainless steel, both eye catching and is crafted to last. The watch’s alligator band was designed to be worn all day and still be comfortable to wear. This bezel is one that will not be forgotten and will always be by your side. It encloses the scratch resistant sapphire crystal of the watch. It has a 330 ft (100 meter) water resistance. </p>\n\n<p>Northeastern Fine Jewelry has sleek, elegant, and luxurious watches for any price level. For more information, call 1-855-795-NEFJ or email at info@nefj.com.</p>\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":7796268,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":11216891,"brand_right":"\"Cartier\"","title_right":" \"Cartier Santos 100 W20072X7\" W20072X7 Watch | Watchfinder & Co.\"","description_right":"\"This Cartier has undergone a thorough inspection of accuracy, functionality and condition at our Cartier certified service centre to determine the level of reconditioning required to meet our strict standards. It has also been checked against our records to ensure authenticity.\", \"\n                            Invented in 1904, the Santos was the first ever men's wristwatch, originally invented for aviation pioneer Alberto Santos-Dumont to make it easier to check the time while flying. The watch was a game-changer in the industry thanks to Santos-Dumont's huge popularity and fame, and to celebrate the origins of the timepiece, Cartier produced a wonderful series of Santos watches called the Santos 100. Modern Santos watches still maintain the classic hallmarks of the original, including the rounded square case, Roman numeral hour markers and fully incorporated lugs—as well as the wonderful gold bezel on this model. \n                            \n                        \" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":49,"row":{"pair_id":"5463413#11815503","label":1,"id_left":5463413,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":477867,"brand_left":"\"Suunto\"@en","title_left":" \"SUUNTO AMBIT 3 PEAK BLACK\"@en BLACK - TREKKING GPS Suunto colour Black SS020677000 Athletic footwear apparel and sports equipment\"@en","description_left":"\"<p>Clock and GPS for Suunto sport model Ambit Peak 3 Black.<br>A GPS clock with advanced features for outdoor and multisport and mobile connection.</p>\n<p>SUUNTO AMBIT3 PEAK: THE ADVENTURE EXPERIENCE<br>The path to the destination is the most important thing – you speak of the mountains or a personal goal. Suunto Ambit3 GPS clock Peak is ideal for sport and adventure. Will guide you at every step, providing you with all the data needed to progress safely in your business. Connect the watch to your iPhone via bluetooth and using Suunto Movescount App to adjust the clock during the activity and to enrich, relive and share your experience. There isn't a better adventure companion to give importance to your every move.</p>\n<p>Main features:</p>\n<p>OUTDOOR AND MULTISPORT<br>-Navigation routes<br>-Operating time max. 50 h with GPS<br>-Compass<br>-Altitude (FusedAltiTM)<br>-Sunrise/sunset<br>-Temperature<br>-Heart rate monitor, swimming (with Suunto Smart Sensor)<br>-Recovery time depending on the activity<br>-Speed, pace and distance<br>-Bike Power Support (Bluetooth Smart)<br>-More sports in a single registration<br>-Training Programs<br>-New functions thanks to Suunto App</p>\n<p>CONNECTIVITY<br>-Upload and share your moves instantaneously (with Suunto Movescount App and Smartphones =<br>-Customize your watch during physical activity (with Suunto Movescount App and Smartphones)<br>-Time and GPS satellite data updated during physical activity (with Suunto Movescount App and Smartphones)<br>-Use your phone as a second display (with Suunto Movescount App and Smartphones)<br>-See your calls, messages, and transfer notifications on the clock (with Suunto Movescount App and Smartphones)</p>\n<p>ENRICH, RELIVE AND SHARE<br>-Take photos during your performance, showing the current speed, distance and other information (with Suunto Movescount App and Smartphones)<br>-Create a video on your Suunto performance with 3D map, key values and images (with Suunto Movescount App and Smartphones)<br>-Share your experience instantly on social networks (with Suunto Movescount App and Smartphones)</p>\n<p>THE DEVICES COMPATIBLE WITH SUUNTO MOVESCOUNT APP ARE:<br>-3° generation iPad and more<br>-iPad iPad Mini/Air<br>-iPhone 4s/iPhone/iPhone 5 5 c/iPhone 5s<br>-5th generation iPod touch</p>\n<p>Dimensions:<br>50x50x18 mm.<br>Weight 89 gr.</p>\n<p>Package contents:<br>-Suunto Ambit3 Peak Black<br>-USB Cable<br>-Quick Guide<br>-Warranty information</p>\"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":" SKU SS020677000 Size S.T. Brand Suunto Product category Trekking Gps Color Black","id_right":11815503,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":477867,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Suunto Men's Ambit 3 Peak Bluetooth GPS Chronograph Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (SS020677000) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_right":"\"Key features: \n\nOUTDOOR AND MULTISPORT\n\nRoute navigation\nUp to 50 h battery life with GPS\nCompass\nAltitude (FusedAltiTM)\nSunrise/sunset\nTemperature\nHeart rate in swimming**\nActivity based recovery time\nSpeed, pace and distance\nBike power support (Bluetooth Smart)\nMultiple sports in one log\nTraining programs\nGrowing feature set through Suunto Apps\n\n**with Suunto Smart Sensor\nNote! The Ambit3 watches are not compatible with ANT+ (e.g. Suunto ANT PODs, Suunto Dual or Suunto ANT belt)\n\nCONNECTIVITY\n\nUpload and share your moves instantly*\nCustomize your watch on the go*\nTime and GPS satellite data up to date on the go*\nUse your phone as second watch display* (Add an extended battery pack for your iPhone to support even longer adventures.)\nSee calls, messages and push notifications on the watch*\n\nENRICH, RELIVE AND SHARE\n\nTake photos during your Move showing your current speed, distance, and more*\nCreate a Suunto Movie of your Move with 3D map, key metrics and images*\nShare your experience instantly to your social media networks*\n\n*with the Suunto Movescount App and smartphone\n\nCOMPATIBLE DEVICES WITH THE SUUNTO MOVESCOUNT APP ARE: \n\niPad 3rd generation and later\niPad Mini/iPad Air\niPhone 4s/iPhone 5/iPhone 5c/iPhone 5s\niPod touch 5thgeneration\niPhone and iPad are trademarks of Apple Inc.\n\nAmbit3 Peak and Ambit3 Sport support notifications from iPhone/iPad in the following languages: English, Dutch, Finnish, French, German, Italian, Portuguese, Spanish and Swedish.\n\nWHAT'S IN THE BOX?\t\nSuunto Ambit3 Peak Black, USB cable, Quick Guide, Warranty Leaflet\"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":50,"row":{"pair_id":"17557272#14768934","label":0,"id_left":17557272,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":854223,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Hamilton Jazzmaster Seaview Day Date Auto Watch H37565131\" \"Shop Hamilton Collection at Safa Jewelers\"","description_left":"\"<p> A trendy watch is not just useful for telling time, it is also a remarkable piece of fine jewelry. This Gents Hamilton H37565131 watch comes from the ever popular Seaview Day Date Auto collection. It features a accurate Automatic (self winding) movement. Some other benefits of this watch are that it is water resistant up to 330 ft (100 meter) and includes a Scratch resistant sapphire crystal. This watch also comes with a generous 2 years international warranty. </p>\n<p> Are you looking for an exceptional gift? This fine timepiece is a thoughtful way to commemorate any occasion. Safa Jewelers is thrilled to be an authorized Hamilton retailer, so you can  all our watches are 100% authentic. These <fine timepieces are designed to endure and will be enjoyed for years to come. </p>\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":14768934,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":1005552,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Hamilton Jazzmaster Day Date Auto Watch H32505731\"","description_right":"\"\n                             A high-end watch is more than just useful for telling time, it is also a enduring piece of fine jewelry. This Gents Hamilton H32505731 watch is from the skillfully crafted Day Date Auto collection. It features a accurate Automatic (self winding) movement. Some other benefits of this watch are that it is water resistant up to 150 ft (50 meter) and includes a Scratch resistant sapphire crystal. This watch also comes with a generous 2 years international warranty. \n Are you looking for an exceptional gift? This fine timepiece is a thoughtful way to commemorate any occasion. Safa Jewelers is privileged to be an authorized Hamilton retailer, so you can  all our watches are 100% authentic. These <fine timepieces are built to last and will be loved for years to come.                         \" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":51,"row":{"pair_id":"7095862#7788749","label":0,"id_left":7095862,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":148701,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Nixon Ladies' The Monopoly Watch\"@en \"Ladies' Watch (A325-1219) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"This ladies Nixon The Monopoly watch is made from PVD gold plated and is fitted with a quartz movement. It is fitted with a gold tone metal  bracelet and has a silver dial.  The watch has a date function. \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":7788749,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":1981397,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Fragole\"@it \"Trollbeads | Fragole - Trollbeads.com\"@it","description_right":"\"\nSono un’esplosione di colori e dolcezza… le fragole avranno sempre un sapore d’estate e di sole. Un pugno di bacche con una piccola perla d’oro al centro.\n\"@it ","price_right":"\"160,00\"@it, \"EUR\"@it","specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":52,"row":{"pair_id":"1613923#9769981","label":0,"id_left":1613923,"category_left":"Sports_and_Outdoors","cluster_id_left":293498,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"TomTom Runner 2 Cardio+Music+HP DBL/LBL (Large) - Sky Captain Blue/Scuba Blue\"@en \" TomTom Running Accessories Blue \"@en","description_left":"\"\n                                    Listen to music, track your heart rate and capture your steps, active minutes and calories burnt 24/7 with the Runner 2 Cardio + Music.Store and listen to over 500 songs on this ultra-slim, lightweight watch with 3GB storage to keep you motivated while you’re on the go. Track your heart rate on your wrist with the built-in heart rate monitor.A goal setting option lets you set your goal and track your progress, so you can keep in control of your work outs, while multisport mode lets you train in run, bike, swim, gym and treadmill modes. GPS is utilised to track your speed, pace, distance in real time and five different heart rate training zones help optimise your training and improve speed and fitness.  Winner of the product of the year ISPO Award 2016/2017 for the Performance category.Features Include:Automatic sleep tracking lets you know how much sleep you're getting each night.Audio performance feedback so you can stay on top of your game.Race mode lets you select one of your past performances to race against.Interval training improves speed and fitness with custom work-rest sessions.Track your performance on the treadmill and in the gym with the indoor training mode.Compatible with a wide range of Bluetooth headphones (available seperately) so you can listen without wires.Wireless syncing to your favourite apps such as TomTom MySports Strava Runkeeper Up Nike+ etc.QuickGPSFix technology finds your location quickly so you can start running sooner.Water resistant to 50m.\n                                \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":9769981,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":55974,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Polar Loop 2 - Smokey Black\"@en \" Polar Running Accessories Black \"@en","description_right":"\"\n                                    This wristband tracks your daily activity and even sleep, motivating and guiding you towards to better fitness and health. The Polar Loop 2 allows you to set individual daily activity goals so you can make the most of your workout, while unique technology allows the Loop to track your daily activity at five intensity levels: resting, sitting, low, medium and high so you can see how much progress you’re making. The soft and flexible wristband fits every wrist perfectly and features 85 individually placed LED lights to give you all the information you need. You can even wear the Loop 2 to bed and let it automatically track your sleep. Check Polar Flow app on your smartphone to see how long and well you slept. If you need a wake-up, the Loop 2 will gently vibrate when it's time to rise and shine.Features Include:Tracks your steps and distance.Free online tool for your coach or personal trainer to easily follow your progress.Add a Polar H7 Bluetooth Smart heart rate sensor for live accurate heart rate on your wrist.Smart Calories lets you know exactly how many calories you've burned.Activity Goal shows how active you've been during the day and gives you practical guidance.\n                                \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":53,"row":{"pair_id":"2266461#5553061","label":0,"id_left":2266461,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":12500095,"brand_left":"\"Omega\"","title_left":" \"Omega Seamaster 300m 2531.80.00\" 2531.80.00 Watch | Watchfinder & Co.\"","description_left":"\"\n                            For a long time, the watch most closely associated with the legendary James Bond franchise was the Rolex Submariner. That all changed in 1995 with the release of GoldenEye. In this super-successful Bond outing, in which Pierce Brosnan gives an iconic performance as the renowned British spy, the watch seen on Bond's wrist is very clearly an Omega Seamaster. From that day forward, Bond has exclusively worn Omega timepieces, a partnership that has catapulted the brand's already prestigious reputation. A series of dazzling limited editions have appeared through the years—but it all started with this superb model.\n                            \n                        \", \"This Omega has undergone a thorough inspection of accuracy, functionality and condition at our Omega certified service centre to determine the level of reconditioning required to meet our strict standards. It has also been checked against our records to ensure authenticity.\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":5553061,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":2899740,"brand_right":"\"Omega\"","title_right":" \"Omega Seamaster Chrono Diver 2599.80.00\" 2599.80.00 Watch | Watchfinder & Co.\"","description_right":"\"\n                            The Seamaster is one of the most iconic diving watches of all time. Following from Omega's Marine in 1932, the world's first commercially available diving watch, the legend of the Seamaster officially debuted in 1948. By the time of 1957's 300M, it was among the most dependable and professionally sought dive watches from any brand, and it soon pioneered some of the sporty must-have features we associate with such watches, including unidirectional bezels, phosphorescent hands and the helium escape valve. This excellent model is a closely related sister watch to the version made famous by Pierce Brosnan as James Bond in 1995's GoldenEye—kicking off Bond's attachment to the Seamaster that continues to this day. \n                            \n                        \", \"This Omega has undergone a thorough inspection of accuracy, functionality and condition at our Omega certified service centre to determine the level of reconditioning required to meet our strict standards. It has also been checked against our records to ensure authenticity.\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":54,"row":{"pair_id":"727263#10526916","label":0,"id_left":727263,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":66696,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Mens Nixon The Brigade Watch A1176-001 \"Men's Watches | Designer For Men Hut\"","description_left":null,"price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":10526916,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":8785385,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Raymond Weil Maestro Watch 2237-STC-20001\" \"Shop Raymond 2237-ST-65001 Watches | Costello Jewelry Company\"","description_right":"\"<p> At Naperville’s most popular jewelry destination we offer a large selection of well-crafted timepieces.We are honored to be a Raymond Weil retailer. As an authorized retailer, you can be sure that every Raymond Weil watch we carry is 100% authentic and backed by a generous warranty.  Raymond Weil watches are crafted for precision and they are purchased for their luxurious details. Whether you are looking for a watch that is stylish and sophisticated or casual and sporty we are confident that you’ll find just what you are looking for. </p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":55,"row":{"pair_id":"1338589#14053857","label":1,"id_left":1338589,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":163505,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Daniel Wellington Men's Dapper 38mm Bristol Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (DW00100090) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"This men's Daniel Wellington Dapper 38mm Bristol watch is made from stainless steel and is fitted with a quartz movement. It is fastened with a brown leather  strap and has a white dial.  The watch has a date function. \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":14053857,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":163505,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Herren Daniel Wellington Dapper 38mm Bristol Uhr DW00100090\"@de","description_right":null,"price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":56,"row":{"pair_id":"17524639#7922683","label":0,"id_left":17524639,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":109665,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Casio Ladies' Baby-G Alarm Chronograph Watch\"@en \"Ladies' Watch (BLX-100-7ER) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"This stunning ladies Casio Baby-g watch has a stainless steel and resin stainless steel and resin case and is powered by a chronograph quartz movement. It is fitted with a white rubber strap and has a LCD dial.  The watch has a date function.  Includes alarm function. \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":7922683,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":13807852,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Chopard Happy Sport Medium Automatic Watch 278559-6003\" 274808-5001 | Dejaun Jewelers\"","description_right":"\"<p> A fine timepiece makes a brilliant statement of style. While most people think watches are simply a practical accessory, a fine timepiece can also add elegance to your look. At Dejaun Jewelers, we are delighted to offer vast selection of some of the worldâ€™s most beloved luxury watch brands, including Chopard. We are also honored to be an authorized Chopard retailer in Los Angeles. Chopard's extraordinary timepieces are designed to last. This Ladies watch with model number 278559-6003 is part of the unique Happy Sport Medium Automatic collection. The water resistance of this watch is 100 ft (30 meter).</p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":57,"row":{"pair_id":"1636368#2310251","label":1,"id_left":1636368,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":126821,"brand_left":"\"Daniel Wellington\"@en","title_left":" \"Glasgow Rose Gold Ladies´ Watch 36mm\"@en \"Daniel Wellington Glasgow 36mm nur € 111.20\"@en","description_left":null,"price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":2310251,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":126821,"brand_right":"\"Daniel Wellington\"@de","title_right":" \"Glasgow Rosegold Damenuhr 36mm\"@de 20 €\"@de \"Daniel Wellington Glasgow 36mm nur 111","description_right":"\"\n\t\t\t\t\tArtikel-Nr.: 1632 DW00100031\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tElegant-moderne Damenuhr der Marke Daniel Wellington.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDie Oberfläche ist poliert und hat eine rosé-goldfarbene IP Beschichtung.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tGehäuse, Zeiger und IndizesIndizes ist das deutsche Wort für das lateinische Index. Spricht man von Indizes, dann sind die Zahlen die die Zeit anzeigen (bei vielen Uhren z.B. arabische Zahlen: 3, 6, 9, 12, aber auch z.B. römische Zahlen: III, VI, IX, XII) oder stattdessen die Platzhalter dafür gemeint. Platzhalter können je nach Gestaltung der Uhr die Unterschiedlichsten Formen haben. Uhrenindexe werden oft nicht nur aufgemalt sondern auch aufgesetzt – bei exklusiven Uhren auch veredelt (mit z.B. Gold, Rosegold, Silber, Chrom). Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon sind aus hochwertigen Edelstahl hergestellt und rosé-goldfarben beschichtet.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tAuf dem Zifferblatt befindet sich ein Daniel Wellington Schriftzug mit Logo.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDas Mineralglas schützt die Uhr vor äußeren Einflüssen.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDer Gehäusedurchmesser beträgt ca. 36 mm und hat eine Höhe von ca. 6 mm.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDas hochwertige Natotextilarmband gewährt einen angenehmen Tragekomfort.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDas Band wird mit einer DornschließeEine Dornschließe beschreibt die Verschlussart einer Uhr.  In dem längeren Armbandteil werden löcher gestanzt. Auf der anderen Seite befindet sich die Dornschließe, welche aus einem Dorn und einem Metallbügel in U-Form, diese verhindert, dass der Dorn aus dem Loch rutscht.\nDornschließen sind an diversen Materialien zu finden und erstrecken sich in alle Preisklasse. Häufig findet man Dornschließen bei Lederarmbändern oder Textilarmbändern.\n\n Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon, auf welcher zusätzlich das Logo graviert ist, verschlossen.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t100 Tage Niedrigpreisgarantie, bei uhrzeit.org kaufen Sie ohne Preisrisiko!\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tFür unsere Waren bestehen die gesetzlichen Gewährleistungsrechte\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\"@de ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":58,"row":{"pair_id":"4602305#12622524","label":0,"id_left":4602305,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":768940,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Michele Serein Watch MWW21A000001\" \"Shop Michele MWW21A000008 Watches | Northeastern Fine Jewelry\"","description_left":"\"<p>This exceptional timepiece, model number MWW21A000001 from Michele offers elegance and high tech functionality for your everyday fashion. This Ladies timepiece features some of the most contemporary and useful features. </p>\n\n<p> \nThis is a watch of enormous functionality and distinct style. A silver dial was decorated to the highest standards in watchmaking. This watch includes small second hand, day, date, central 60 second hand complications. Its complications will amaze you because of this piece’s technical precision. The numbers on this timepiece are in roman numeral style, adding to this piece’s luxurious feel. The neat round case is 40 mm. The case is expertly crafted of stainless steel, both attention grabbing and structurally stable. The watch’s stainless steel band fits snugly and fashionably over your wrist. This watch's bezel features gorgeous stainless steel that speaks for itself. This bezel is one for the ages and will always be by your side. It encloses the scratch resistant sapphire crystal of the watch. It has a 150 ft (50 meter) water resistance. The true highlight of this piece is the diamonds that are located in the bezel of this watch. </p>\n\n<p>Northeastern Fine Jewelry knows exactly what features watch lovers adore. For more information, call 1-855-795-NEFJ or email at info@nefj.com.</p>\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":12622524,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":148639,"brand_right":"\"Fossil\"","title_right":" \"Fossil ES3487 watch\"","description_right":"\"            \t                    The Jacqueline collection of Fossil distinguished by its appearance. This classic watch is really a must-have. The model is set with CZ stones. This makes for a tough but elegant look. The size of the case is 30 mm. The model has a bandwidth of 7 mm. The color of the steel band is brown and the case has a beautiful rose gold color. The wateresistance is 3 Atm. / 30 meters. 2 year guarantee on the movement. With a Fossil watch you always have a good quality model at an affordable price.In addition, the models from Fossil are always based on the latest fashion trends.            \t                    \n            \t                        Read more            \t                        Close            \t                        \n    \t                        \" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":59,"row":{"pair_id":"5565685#5775498","label":1,"id_left":5565685,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":637661,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Seiko Prospex SRP773K1 Turtle\"@en-US Turtle | reseller jam\"@en-US","description_left":null,"price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":5775498,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":637661,"brand_right":"\"Seiko\"@en","title_right":" \"Prospex Diver´s Revival Automatic Watch\"@en \"Seiko Prospex Watch SRP773K1 nur € 439.00\"@en","description_right":null,"price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":60,"row":{"pair_id":"15355215#17557409","label":0,"id_left":15355215,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":11213997,"brand_left":"\"Cartier\"","title_left":" \"Cartier Santos 100 W20073X8\" W20073X8 Watch | Watchfinder & Co.\"","description_left":"\"This Cartier has undergone a thorough inspection of accuracy, functionality and condition at our Cartier certified service centre to determine the level of reconditioning required to meet our strict standards. It has also been checked against our records to ensure authenticity.\", \"\n                            Invented in 1904, the Santos was the first ever men's wristwatch, originally invented for aviation pioneer Alberto Santos-Dumont to make it easier to check the time while flying. The watch was a game-changer in the industry thanks to Santos-Dumont's huge popularity and fame, and to celebrate the origins of the timepiece, Cartier produced a wonderful series of Santos watches called the Santos 100. Modern Santos watches still maintain the classic hallmarks of the original, including the rounded square case, Roman numeral hour markers and fully incorporated lugs. \n                            \n                        \" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":" Name Monthly Repayment Total Amount Cost of Credit APR Interest Free Finance (6 Months) £496.25 £3,970.00 £0.00 0% Interest Free Finance (12 Months) £248.12 £3,970.00 £0.00 0% Classic Credit 24 Months 9.9% £136.70 £4,273.30 £303.30 9.9% Classic Credit 36 Months 9.9% £95.35 £4,425.10 £455.10 9.9% Classic Credit 48 Months 9.9% £74.79 £4,582.42 £612.42 9.9%","id_right":17557409,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":11216891,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Cartier Santos 100 Watch W20072X7\" \"Shop Cartier WSSA0006 Watches | Northeastern Fine Jewelry\"","description_right":"\"<p>This lustrous watch, model number W20072X7 from Cartier gives luxury and high tech functionality for watch lovers. This Gents timepiece adopts a distinctive design as well as classic watchmaking details. </p>\n\n<p> \nThis is the watch of insurmountable functionality and distinct style. A silver dial comes complete with intricate hour and minute markings that you’ll love. Its automatic (self winding) movement has unrivaled high-precision. This watch includes central 60 second hand complications. Its complications are distinctively positioned for easy reading. The numbers on this timepiece are in roman numeral style, adding to this piece’s luxurious feel. The case is expertly created out of 18k yellow gold, both attention grabbing and structurally stable. The watch’s alligator band was designed to be worn all day and still be comfortable to wear. This bezel is one that will not be forgotten and will always be found on your wrist. It encloses the scratch resistant sapphire crystal of the watch. It has a 100 ft (30 meter) water resistance. </p>\n\n<p>Northeastern Fine Jewelry knows exactly what features watch lovers adore. For more information, call 1-855-795-NEFJ or email at info@nefj.com.</p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":61,"row":{"pair_id":"1743996#5252524","label":1,"id_left":1743996,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":679144,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Tissot Men's Classic Dream Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (T0334102205301) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"Mens Tissot Classic Dream watch in a stylish two-tone design in steel and gold plate. The black dial has a date function and elegant Roman numeral hour markers.\"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":5252524,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":679144,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Mens Classic Dream Watch \"@de \"Tissot T-klassisch Uhren | Official TISSOT Stockist\"@de","description_right":null,"price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":62,"row":{"pair_id":"7095862#9293671","label":0,"id_left":7095862,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":148701,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Nixon Ladies' The Monopoly Watch\"@en \"Ladies' Watch (A325-1219) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"This ladies Nixon The Monopoly watch is made from PVD gold plated and is fitted with a quartz movement. It is fitted with a gold tone metal  bracelet and has a silver dial.  The watch has a date function. \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":9293671,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":5316084,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Panerai 2013 Watch PAM00532\" \"Shop Panerai PAM00538 Watches | Northeastern Fine Jewelry\"","description_right":"\"<p>This well crafted luxury watch, model number PAM00532 from Panerai gives beauty and first-rate functionality for the modern watch user. This Gents timepiece features some of the most contemporary and useful features. </p>\n\n<p> \nThis is a watch of numerous functionality and distinct style. A black dial was decorated to the highest standards in watchmaking. Its manual winding movement features complications you’ll come to cherish. This watch includes small second hand complications. Its complications will amaze you because of this piece’s technical precision. The numbers on this timepiece are in indexes, arabic style, adding to this piece’s luxurious feel. The neat cushion case is 47 mm. The case is finely crafted of stainless steel, both eye catching and structurally stable. The watch’s leather band is smooth and made out of the highest quality materials. This watch's bezel features eye-catching stainless steel that speaks volumes. This bezel is one for the ages and will always be found on your wrist. It has a 330 ft (100 meter) water resistance. </p>\n\n<p>Northeastern Fine Jewelry knows exactly what features watch lovers adore. For more information, call 1-855-795-NEFJ or email at info@nefj.com.</p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":63,"row":{"pair_id":"11410756#8668681","label":0,"id_left":11410756,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":353191,"brand_left":"\"Suunto\"@en","title_left":" \"SUUNTO TRAVERSE ALPHA STEALTH\"@en apparel and sports equipment\"@en STEALTH - TREKKING WATCH Suunto colour Black SS022469000 Athletic footwear","description_left":"\"<p>Suunto sports watch Alpha Traverse Stealth GPS/Glonass functionality. Outdoor activities will always be under control with this new versatile and reliable measurement and navigation tool. The Alpha version is designed for outdoor works related to hunting and fishing.</p>\n<p>Go Explore<br>Suunto Traverse Alpha conjugates qualities of a sturdy structure and a full range of features for outdoors. Is your guide in the wilderness, which helps keep the GPS/GLONASS navigation guidance. Specific features for hunting and fishing will provide useful tools for your business, including the timing of lunar phases, stroke detection, the alert dawn, the weather trend indicator, and the red backlight for night use. Plan routes and keep a diary of your fishing and hunting outings with SuunTo Movescount.com.<p>\n<p>The moon phase calendar based on the position with the time of rise and decline of the Moon helps you determine the best times for fishing, while the barometric pressure graph allows you to precisely follow the weather changes.</p>\n<p>Automatic identification of hit tracks the number and position of the strokes. While exploring, you can use the specific POI to mark the routes and important positions. Sunrise and sunset Alerts help you plan your day, while customizable red backlight does not interfere with your night vision.</p>\n<p>Create routes on Suunto Movescount with topographic maps and elevation data. View profile of altitude of your itinerary directly from the watch. The atmospheric pressure measurement integrated sensor keeps track of your climb with precision. Save points of interest along the route and,If necessary, retrace your steps with the automatic route tracking feature (breadcrumb). Using the digital compass to orient yourself quickly on unknown territory.<p>\n<p>With knurled stainless steel bezel, black nylon strap waterproof and scratch-resistant Sapphire Crystal, Suunto Traverse Alpha is the perfect watch for hunters, fishermen and hikers who want an extremely durable. Vibrating alerts and the red backlight, compatible with night vision goggles, they make you go unnoticed.</p>\n<p>Outdoor watches, Suunto sleepers and Traverse Alpha have been tested in accordance with military standards (MIL STD 819G). Have passed the 19 tests, including tests for vibration, shock, drop, freezing and thawing, rain, humidity, immersion, dust and sand.</p>\n<p>Dominates the area with GPS/GLONASS navigation: uses features specific to the cacCIA, fishing and hiking. Suunto Traverse is manufactured in Finland and tested according to military standards.<p>\n<p>Main features:<br>-How hiking, fishing and hunting<br>-Hours and warnings of sunrise and sunset<br>-POI types specific to fishing and hunting<br>-Moon phases and times of rise and decline of the Moon<br>-Automatic detection of stroke<br>-Red Backlight, night vision compatible<br>-GPS and GLONASS for sailing routes and POIs<br>-Automatic route tracking feature (breadcrumb) in real time<br>-Detection of speed, distance and altitude<br>-Route planning in Suunto Movescount.com with topographic maps<br>-Preview of route and altitude profile of the route on the clock<br>-Water resistance to 100 m/330 feet<br>-Altitude (FusedAlti ™)<br>Weather trends and storm alarm<br>-Knockthe<br>-Backlight flashlight mode<br>-Vibration<br>-GPS update now<br>-Monitoring of steps and calories during daily activities, weekly, monthly, and yearly<br>-Notifications on your phone<br>-Compatible with Suunto Movescount (iOS and Android)<p>\n<p>Package contents:<br>-Suunto Traverse Alpha Stealth<br>-USB cable<br>-Quick Start Guide<br>-Warranty information</p>\"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":" SKU SS022469000 Size S.T. Brand Suunto Product category Trekking Watch Color Black EAN 6417084201928","id_right":8668681,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":623956,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Apple Watch Nike+, 38mm Gris espacial Aluminio Funda Negro/Volt Nike Sport Correa\"@es 42mm Camellia Band - Black Friday 2017 \"@es","description_right":"\"Null\"@es ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":64,"row":{"pair_id":"9911916#8870479","label":1,"id_left":9911916,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":531368,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Daniel Wellington Ladies' Winchester Rose 36mm Watch\"@en \"Ladies' Watch (DW00100033) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"This slim-line ladies Daniel Wellington Winchester Rose 36mm watch has a PVD rose plating case and is powered by an analogue quartz movement. It fastens a multicolour fabric strap and has a cream dial. \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":8870479,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":531368,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Damen Daniel Wellington Winchester Rose 36mm Uhr DW00100033\"@de","description_right":null,"price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":65,"row":{"pair_id":"4904480#8417827","label":0,"id_left":4904480,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":12727,"brand_left":"\"Daniel Wellington\"@pl","title_left":" \"Classic Black Bristol Silver 40mm\"@pl 00 €\"@pl \"Daniel Wellington Classic 40mm nur 189","description_left":null,"price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":8417827,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":563062,"brand_right":"\"Daniel Wellington\"@es","title_right":" \"Bristol Silver Reloj para mujer 36mm\"@es \"Daniel Wellington Bristol 36mm nur 169 00 €\"@es","description_right":null,"price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":66,"row":{"pair_id":"8705003#2862685","label":1,"id_left":8705003,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":33479,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Polar M400 - Black HR\"@en \" Polar HR Accessories 90051341 \"@en","description_left":"\"\n                                    Polar M400 HR - BlackThe Polar M400 HR GPS watch is for urban and trail runners who want a sporty design with advanced GPS and training features, along with loads of options to keep an eye on your activity.Track your pace, distance and altitude with the built-in GPS, and follow your 24/7 activity, calories and steps. You can also plan, sync and share your training with the Polar Flow mobile app and web service and set targets to beat your personal best.Find your way back home with Back to Start and train at the right intensity within your personal heart rate zones.Features Include:M400 training computerPolar H7 heart rate sensorUSB cablePolar M400 Getting Started Guide\n                                \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":2862685,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":33479,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Montre Polar M400 Noir avec Ceinture Cardio\" Avec Cardio - Que-Du-Sport\"","description_right":"\"Montre Polar M400 Noir avec Ceinture Cardio \n\n \n\n \n\nCIBLE: les Sport Actives\n\n \n\nQui sont-ils?\n• 25 – 45 ans\n• Le sport ainsi que la communauté autour du sport est très important pour eux Pourquoi s’entraînent-ils?\n• Améliorer leur forme pour être meilleur dans leur sport de prédilection\n• Montrer aux autres qu’ils sont performant Comment s’entraînent-ils?\n• Gym, running, vélo\n• Sports d’équipe\n• Avec des amis\n• 3-5h / semaine Leurs attentes:\n• Meilleure forme, meilleur physique, s’améliorer dans un sport spécifique et avoir de la reconnaissance de la part de leur ”groupe”\n\n \n\nPoints clés: Design & Look\n\n\nUn cardio-GPS compact et accessible\n•Design soigné, hi-tech\n•Elegant, léger et fin (11mm)\n•Finitions de qualité\n•Smart Watch 24/7\n•Bracelet souple confortable\n•Ecran haute resolution N&B (interchangeable)\n•Couleurs H/F\n\n \n\nPoints clés: Fonctionnalités\n\n \n\nGPS intégré\n- Technologie “Quick GPSFix”\n- Connexion rapide aux satelites\n\nAltitude\n\n- via le GPS\n\nMulti-sport\n- Jusqu’à 20 profils sportif\n- Vues d’entraînement entièrement parametrables\nTracker d’activité\n- 24/7\n\nFonctions Smart Coaching\n- Training Program & Target Planning\n- Training Benefit\n\n- Running Index\n- Fitness Test\n\nBluetooth Smart\n- Polar Flow Service\n- Polar Flow mobile app\n\n \n\nEcosystème du M400\n\nEmetteur FC\n- (BT Smart)\nFlow web\n\n- Synchro via USB (PC ou Mac)\nFlow app\n- Synchro via BT smart (iOS ou Android)\n\n \n\nFonctions Smart Coaching\n• TRAINING BENEFIT\n• RUNNING INDEX (RI)\n• ACTIVITE QUOTIDIENNE\n• SMART CALORIES\n• TEST DE FITNESS\n• NEW PROGRAMMES D’ENTRAINEMENT\n\n \n\nNEW Programmes d’Entraînement Polar\n\n\nConseils et plans d’entraînement personnalisés en fonction de vos objectifs et de votre niveau:\n1.Definition du niveau (questionnaire)\n2.Definition de l’objectif – améliorer ses perfs de course, courir 5 km, préparer un 10 km, semi marathon, marathon\n3.Mise à l’agenda des sessions et suggestions d’entrainements pour l’atteinte de l’objectif.\n\n \n\nActivité 24/7\n\n \n\nTRACKER D’ACTIVITE\nGrâce à un accelerometre 3D, le M400 suit toute votre activité:\n- Determine les objectifs quotidien à partir des données physiques et de la journée type.\n- Suivi des progrès tout au long de la journée et conseils pour atteindre son objectif.\n- Visualisation du temps d’activité total, calories depensées et les pas/distance tous les jours\n- Notification d’inactivités lorsqu’il est temps de se bouger!\n\n \n\nPOLAR FLOW APP\nL’application mobile Polar Flow donne des infos globales avec des resumés quotidiens, hebdomadaires et mensuels sur l’activité et le sommeil:\n- Objectifs d’activité avec des conseils pour les atteindre\n- Benefice quotidien\n- Niveaux d’intensité d’activité\n- Temps actif total\n- Calories\n- Pas/distance\n- Temps de sommeil / indice\n- Alertes d’inactivité\n\n \n\nAutres Fonctions\n\nMONTRE\n• Heure, date & alarme\n• Differents écrans d’affichage de l’heure\nPOLAR SPORT ZONES\n• 5 sport zones, Zone Lock, Zone Pointer\nTIMERS NEW!\n• Fractionnés (tps et/ou distance) sur le M400\n• Estimation du temps d’arrivée.\nPERSONAL BEST NEW!\n• Vous felicite chaque fois que vous battez un record personnel\n\nHISTORIQUE D’ENTRAINEMENT\n• 2 semaines\nPROFILS SPORTIFS\n• Jusqu’à 8 sports\n• Parametrables dans Flow web\nPOLAR FLOW WEB\nPOLAR FLOW APP\n•IOS & Android\nBACK-TO-START\n\n \n\nFonctions Techniques\nTAILLE\n• Poids 56,6g\n• Epaisseur 11,5 mm\nECRAN\n• Haute Resolution, N&B, vitre plastique\n• Jusqu’à 4 données à l’ecran (entrainement)\nGPS INTEGRE\n• Vitesse, distance, altitude, parcours(Flow)\n• Acquisition du signal rapide\nACTIVITE\n• Activité quotidienne\n• Sommeil(Flow App, Flow web)\nTOURS\n• Manuel\n• Autolaps (temps ou distance)\nALERTES SONORES\n\nCAPTEURS\n• Emetteur de FC Bluetooth Smart (vendu avec le H6)\nWATERPROOF\n• WR30\nMEMOIRE 4MB\n• 30h d’entrainement avec GPS et FC\nBATTERIE\n• Rechargeable (USB)\n• Autonomie: 9h GPS actif, 24 jours en mode “heure” avec l’activité (tbc).\nCONNECTIVITE\n• USB\n• BT Smart pour le tel\nMAJ SW\nLANGUES\n• 13\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":67,"row":{"pair_id":"5077253#6651457","label":0,"id_left":5077253,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":2870961,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Maurice Lacroix Les Classiques Watch LC1087-SD501-160\" \"Shop Maurice LC1087-SS002-120-1 Watches | Costello Jewelry Company\"","description_left":"\"<p> At Costello Jewelry Company in Naperville, IL we offer a wide selection of precise watches.We are thrilled to be a Maurice Lacroix retailer. As an authorized retailer, you can be sure that every Maurice Lacroix watch we carry is 100% authentic and backed by a generous warranty.  Maurice Lacroix watches are built for precision and they are loved for their attention to detail. This LC1087-SD501-160 Genuine croco Ladies Maurice Lacroix watch features a Scratch resistant sapphire crystal for worry-free wear. Whether you are looking for a watch that is stylish and sophisticated or casual and sporty we are confident that you’ll find just what you are looking for. </p>\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":6651457,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":4284443,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Maurice Lacroix Les Classiques Watch LC1087-SS002-120-1\" \"Shop Maurice LC1087-SD502-160 Watches | Costello Jewelry Company\"","description_right":"\"<p> At Costello Jewelry Company in Naperville we offer a large selection of well-crafted watches.We are proud to be a Maurice Lacroix retailer. As an authorized retailer, you can be sure that every Maurice Lacroix watch we offer is 100% authentic an