Accuracy of +- 15 Seconds Per Month Daylight Savings Time Function Power Reserve Indicator Calendar (Date Display) Power Save Function 2 Years Eco-Drive Power Reserve Insufficient Charge Warning Overcharging Prevention Function Display Analog Dial Color Blue Case Width 43mm Case Depth 10mm Weight 153g Water Resistance 100m"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":70,"row":{"pair_id":"1613923#8852230","label":1,"id_left":1613923,"category_left":"Sports_and_Outdoors","cluster_id_left":293498,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"TomTom Runner 2 Cardio+Music+HP DBL/LBL (Large) - Sky Captain Blue/Scuba Blue\"@en \" TomTom Running Accessories Blue \"@en","description_left":"\"\n                                    Listen to music, track your heart rate and capture your steps, active minutes and calories burnt 24/7 with the Runner 2 Cardio + Music.Store and listen to over 500 songs on this ultra-slim, lightweight watch with 3GB storage to keep you motivated while you’re on the go. Track your heart rate on your wrist with the built-in heart rate monitor.A goal setting option lets you set your goal and track your progress, so you can keep in control of your work outs, while multisport mode lets you train in run, bike, swim, gym and treadmill modes. GPS is utilised to track your speed, pace, distance in real time and five different heart rate training zones help optimise your training and improve speed and fitness.  Winner of the product of the year ISPO Award 2016/2017 for the Performance category.Features Include:Automatic sleep tracking lets you know how much sleep you're getting each night.Audio performance feedback so you can stay on top of your game.Race mode lets you select one of your past performances to race against.Interval training improves speed and fitness with custom work-rest sessions.Track your performance on the treadmill and in the gym with the indoor training mode.Compatible with a wide range of Bluetooth headphones (available seperately) so you can listen without wires.Wireless syncing to your favourite apps such as TomTom MySports Strava Runkeeper Up Nike+ etc.QuickGPSFix technology finds your location quickly so you can start running sooner.Water resistant to 50m.\n                                \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":8852230,"category_right":"Sports_and_Outdoors","cluster_id_right":293498,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"TomTom Runner 2 Cardio + Music Large Bluetooth koptelefoon Zwart (Blauw, Zwart) - Prijzen \"@NL Tweakers\"@NL (Blauw","description_right":null,"price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":" Categorie Wearables Merk TomTom Product TomTom Runner 2 Cardio + Music Uitvoering Large + Bluetooth koptelefoon Zwart (Blauw, Zwart) EAN 0636926076357 SKU 1RFM.001.05 Tweakers ID 518241"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":71,"row":{"pair_id":"1969353#1900844","label":0,"id_left":1969353,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":320278,"brand_left":"\"Tissot\"@en","title_left":" \" Tissot Classic Dream Watch \"@en \"Tissot - T0332101611100 | Ben Bridge Jeweler\"@en","description_left":"\"Tissot T-Classic quartz watch in stainless steel with a leather strap.\"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":1900844,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":8389145,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Bvlgari LVCEA Watch LU36C6SSPGD\" LU33C6SSD | Dejaun Jewelers\"","description_right":"\"<p> A fine watch makes a brilliant statement of style. While many people think watches are simply a practical tool, a fine timepiece can also finish your look. At Dejaun Jewelers, we are thrilled to offer vast selection of some of the worldâ€™s finest luxury watch brands, including Bvlgari. We are also grateful to be an authorized Bvlgari retailer in Los Angeles. Bvlgari's unique timepieces are crafted to last. This Ladies watch with model number LU36C6SSPGD is part of the unique LVCEA collection.</p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":72,"row":{"pair_id":"17557321#12561499","label":0,"id_left":17557321,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":4695073,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Chopard Hour And Minutes Watch 388532-3002\" 388531-6004 | Dejaun Jewelers\"","description_left":"\"<p> A finely crafted timepiece makes a bold statement of style. While most people think watches are simply a practical accessory, a fine timepiece can also showcase your style. At Dejaun Jewelers, we are proud to offer diverse selection of some of the worldâ€™s finest luxury watch brands, including Chopard. We are also honored to be an authorized Chopard retailer in Los Angeles. Chopard's unique timepieces are designed to endure. This Ladies watch with model number 388532-3002 is part of the ever popular Hour and Minutes collection. The water resistance of this watch is 150 ft (50 meter).</p>\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":12561499,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":51507,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Raymond Weil Toccata Watch 5988-STP-97081\" \"Shop Raymond 5988-ST-97081 Watches | Costello Jewelry Company\"","description_right":"\"<p> At Naperville’s premier jeweler we offer a comprehensive selection of luxury watches.We are honored to be a Raymond Weil retailer. As an authorized retailer, you can rest assured that every Raymond Weil watch we carry is 100% authentic and backed by a generous warranty.  Raymond Weil watches are built for comfort and they are known for their attention to detail. This 5988-STP-97081 Gold plated stainless steel, Stainless steel Ladies Raymond Weil watch features a Scratch resistant sapphire crystal for worry-free wear. Whether you are looking for a watch that is stylish and sophisticated or casual and sporty we are confident that you’ll find just what you are looking for. </p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":73,"row":{"pair_id":"8442418#7752346","label":0,"id_left":8442418,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":6203006,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Michele Serein Watch MW21A01B0966_MS18EV246710\" \"Shop Michele MWW21A000001 Watches | Costello Jewelry Company\"","description_left":"\"<p> At Naperville’s favorite jeweler we offer a wide selection of well-crafted watches.We are delighted to be a Michele retailer. As an authorized retailer, you can be sure that every Michele watch we carry is 100% authentic and backed by a generous warranty.  Michele watches are built for comfort and they are loved for their attention to detail. This MW21A01B0966_MS18EV246710 Gold plated stainless steel Ladies Michele watch features a Scratch resistant sapphire crystal for worry-free wear. Whether you are looking for a watch that is stylish and sophisticated or casual and sporty we are confident that you’ll find just what you are looking for. </p>\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":7752346,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":4906621,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Michele Serein Watch MWW21A000008\" \"Shop Michele MW21A01B0966_MS18EV246710 Watches | Costello Jewelry Company\"","description_right":"\"<p> At Costello Jewelry Company in Naperville, IL we offer a large selection of precise watches.We are thrilled to be a Michele retailer. As an authorized retailer, you can be sure that every Michele watch we carry is 100% authentic and backed by a generous warranty.  Michele watches are built to last and they are purchased for their attention to detail. This MWW21A000008 Stainless steel, 18k yellow gold plated Ladies Michele watch features a Scratch resistant sapphire crystal for worry-free wear. Whether you are looking for a watch that is stylish and sophisticated or casual and sporty we are confident that you’ll find just what you are looking for. </p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":74,"row":{"pair_id":"7265647#4403350","label":0,"id_left":7265647,"category_left":"not found","cluster_id_left":14503814,"brand_left":"\"TomTom\"@en","title_left":" \"TomTom Runner 2 Cardio GPS & Heart Rate Watch Black - Small Strap\"@en Strap · TomTom Running ah\"@en","description_left":"\"\n\n24/7 Activity Tracking - Capture your steps, active minutes and calories burnt.\nBuilt-in Heart Rate Monitor - Get accurate heart rate information on your wrist.\nGoal Setting - Challenge yourself to a daily or weekly target. Steps, calories, distance or active time. Set your goal and track your progress.\nMultisport Mode - Train in run, bike, swim, gym and treadmill modes.\nGPS Tracking - Track your speed, pace, distance, time and calories burnt.\nAutomatic Sleep Tracking - Know if you're getting the sleep you need.\n5 Heart Rate Training Zones - Train in 5 different zones to get results faster.\nRace Mode - Select one of your past performances to race against.\nInterval Training - Improve speed and fitness with custom work-rest sessions.\nIndoor Training Mode - Track your performance on the treadmill or in the gym.\n\nSports\n\n\nTreadmill - Tracks heart rate, speed, pace, distance, calories burnt and duration\n\n\nRunning - Tracks heart rate, speed, pace, distance, calories burnt and duration\n\n\nCycling - Tracks heart rate, speed, pace, distance, calories burnt and duration (Cadence - through an optional cadence sensor)\n\n\nIndoor Cycling - Tracks heart rate, calories burnt and duration (Cadence, speed, pace and distance - through an optional cadence sensor)\n\n\nSwimming - Tracks laps, distance, speed, duration, calories burnt and strokes\n\n\nFreestyle - Tracks heart rate, speed, pace, distance, calories burnt and duration\n\n\nGym - Tracks duration, heart rate and calories burnt\n\n\n\nActivity Tracking\n\nActivity Measurements - Steps, active minutes, distance, calories burnt and sleep\nRunning - Tracks heart rate, speed, pace, distance, calories burnt and duration\n\n\nViews - Daily and weekly\n\n\nGoals - Steps, active minutes, distance or calories burnt\nTraining\n\n\nGoals - Time, distance or calories\n\n\nIntervals -Yes\n\n\nLaps - Time / Distance / Manual\n\n\nRace - Past activities, favorites and custom\n\n\nZone - Pace, heart rate or speed\n\n\n\nWeight and Dimensions\n\nBattery lifetime - Activity tracking: up to 3 weeks, GPS: up to 11 hours, GPS + Heart Rate: up to 9 hours\n\n\nDisplay resolution - 144x168\n\n\nDisplay size - 22x25 mm\n\n\nThickness - 13.7 mm\nWeight - 50 g\n\n\nWrist Size - 121-175 mm\nSensors\n\n\nSensors (internal) - Motion sensor (accelerometer + gyro), compass, optical heart rate monitor\n\n\nSensor (wireless) - Bluetooth® Smart\n\n\nAlerts - Beep & Vibrate\n\n\n\nWater Resistance\n\nWaterproofing - 40 m / 130 feet (5 ATM)\n\n\n\n\n\n \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":4403350,"category_right":"Other_Electronics","cluster_id_right":16064940,"brand_right":"\"TomTom\"@en","title_right":" \"TomTom Runner 3 Cardio + Music GPS Sports Watch Bluetooth Headphones - Black / Green\"@en Green online\"@en","description_right":"\"Run with over 500 songs and your heart rate on your wristFeatures\n\nBuilt-in Heart Rate Monitor: See your heart rate on your wrist with the built-in heart rate monitor. No chest strap needed.*\nGPS Tracking: Time. Distance. Speed. Pace. Routes. Live stats, on the go.\nPlay over 500 songs from your watch: Over 500 Songs of Music Storage (3GB)\nMultisport Modes: Track all your sports. Run. Bike. Swim. Treadmill. Gym. Indoor cycling and more.\nRoute Exploration: Explore new routes and find your way back to the start.\nLong Battery Life: Get up to 11 hours of battery lifetime when tracking yourself with GPS\n24/7 Activity Tracking: Capture your heart rate, steps, active minutes, and calories burned throughout the day.\nRace Mode: Select one of your past performances to race against.\nInterval Training: Improve speed and fitness with custom work-rest sessions.\nPerfect Fit: Select large or small watch straps to ensure the perfect fit for your wrist.\nIndoor Training Mode: Track your performance on the treadmill or in the gym.\nWireless Syncing: Sync your watch wirelessly with your favourite running apps.\nWater Resistant to 40m: Get wet. Dive into the pool and run in all weather conditions.\nCustomisable Straps: Switch watch straps to fit your kit or match your mood.\nSocial sharing: Celebrate your success with friends. Share your workouts online.\nQuickGPS: Get started faster with quicker GPS reception\nUltra-Slim Design: Notice your watch only when you want to\nOne-Button Control: Navigate easily through menus with a single button.\nGoal Setting: Set and track your progress on daily and weekly goals.\nAutomatic Sleep Tracking: Track your sleep patterns and know if you're getting the sleep you need.\n5 Heart Rate Training Zones: Training in 5 different heart rate zones helps to get results faster.\"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":75,"row":{"pair_id":"3006684#3062867","label":1,"id_left":3006684,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":973439,"brand_left":"\"Nixon\"@pl","title_left":" \"The Facet 38 All Silver\"@pl 00 €\"@pl \"Nixon The Silver A4091920 nur 129","description_left":null,"price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":" obudowa Ø koperty:: 38 mm kształt: owalny kolor obudowy: srebro szkło: szkło mineralne materiał: stal nierdzewna","id_right":3062867,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":973439,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Nixon Ladies' The Facet 38 Watch\"@en \"Ladies' Watch (A409-1920) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_right":"\"This ladies Nixon The Facet 38 watch has a stainless steel case and is fitted with a quartz movement. It fastens a silver metal  bracelet and has a white dial. \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":76,"row":{"pair_id":"4917169#15156209","label":0,"id_left":4917169,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":252764,"brand_left":"\"Daniel Wellington\"@en","title_left":" \"Daniel Wellington Women's Quartz Watch Classic St Mawes Lady 0507DW with Leather Strap\"@en \"Price comparison: Daniel","description_left":"\"\n                                                                        \n                                                            Protective mineral glass window lens\n                                                            Round stainless steel case\n                                                            Leather strap with buckle, Water resistant to 30m\n                                                        \n                                                                                        Daniel Wellington Women's Quartz Watch Classic St Mawes Lady 0507DW with Leather Strap\n                        This slim-line ladies Daniel Wellington St Mawes Rose 36mm watch has a PVD rose plating case and is powered by a quartz movement. It is fitted with a brown leather strap and has a cream dial.\n                                    \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":15156209,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":194665,"brand_right":"\"Daniel Wellington\"@en","title_right":" \"Daniel Wellington Women's Quartz Watch Classic Canterbury Lady 0502DW with Plastic Strap\"@en \"Price comparison: Daniel","description_right":"\"\n                                                                        \n                                                            Round watch in slim rose gold-tone case featuring white dial with logo and stick hands/indices\n                                                            Water resistant to 30m (99 ft.): in general, withstands splashes or brief immersion in water, but not suitable for swimming\n                                                            36mm rose-gold case with mineral dial window\n                                                        \n                                                                                        Daniel Wellington Women's Quartz Watch Classic Canterbury Lady 0502DW with Plastic Strap\n                        This slim-line ladies Daniel Wellington Canterbury Rose 36mm watch is made from PVD rose plating and is fitted with an analogue quartz movement. It is fitted with a multicolour fabric strap and has a cream dial.\n                                    \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":77,"row":{"pair_id":"10760238#10646719","label":0,"id_left":10760238,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":15145,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Garmin Forerunner 235 - Black Frost Blue\"@en \" Garmin Running Accessories & Blue \"@en","description_left":"\"\n                                    Take the next step as a runner with this easy to use GPS watch that lets you track how far, how fast and how long you’re running. Instantly share your runs and tracking progress with friends, family and the world via social media by pairing a compatible device with Garmin Connect™ Network. Activity tracking counts steps and calories and reminds you when it’s time to move, while heart rate compatibility allows you to train with heart rate zones so you know when to push it on that last mile or when to reign it in.  Forerunner 235 is also compatible with GPS and GLONASS satellites which track your location, whether you are running out in the sticks or in the city.You can also receive weather forecasts and conditions via the app's wireless connectivity.Features Include:Connected features²: automatic uploads to Garmin Connect™ live tracking audio prompts music controls smart notifications and social media sharing.Tracks pace distance time heart rate¹ and more.Activity tracking³ counts calories distance daily steps and sleep.Download data fields watch faces widgets and applications from Connect IQ™\n                                \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":10646719,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":8764025,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Garmin Forerunner 15 Large HRM 1- Black/Blue\"@en \" Garmin Accessories - Black/Blue \"@en","description_right":"\"\n                                    The Forerunner 15 tracks distance, pace, calories and heart rate (HRM included). The activity tracking counts steps and calories and reminds you when it’s time to move. The watch is also compatible with foot pod (sold separately) for recording distance indoors. The battery life is up to 8 hours with GPS on or 5 weeks in watch/activity tracking mode. Further functions of the watch enable you to save, plan and share your activities at Garmin Connect™.As well as capturing essential stats from your run like time, distance and pace, when paired with a heart rate monitor (included) the Forerunner 15 also records your heart rate and heart rate zone so you’ll know when you hit your target. Training with heart rate also allows you to monitor when you need to rein it in and when you can push yourself harder.The watch also has an auto lap function that automatically alerts you when you complete each mile, giving you a beep and a backlit screen that flashes your time for that mile. When you complete your run and save it, you’ll see a summary of how you did, including your total time, distance, average pace and calories. Forerunner 15 even lets you know when you achieve a personal record, like your fastest mile or longest run to date.For outdoor runs, Forerunner 15 uses GPS to accurately record your time, pace and distance. To track distance and pace when you hit the treadmill or an indoor track, just pair Forerunner 15 with an optional foot pod, which attaches to the laces of your shoe.Forerunner 15 counts your steps and the calories you burn all day. When you upload your data to Garmin Connect, this allows you to monitor your progress toward fitness goals and see overall fitness trends. Forerunner 15 also reminds you when it’s time to move if you’ve been sitting for more than an hour. When you get that cue to move, just walk for a couple of minutes to reset the inactivity indicator.You won’t have to worry about charging Forerunner every night. The rechargeable battery will last up to 5 weeks in watch/activity tracking mode or 8 hours when using it with GPS on your outdoor runs. Forerunner 15 has a water rating of 5 ATM (50 meters), which means it resists rain and sweat and can even join you for a swim.With a simple connection to your Mac® or PC, you can upload your activities to Garmin’s free online fitness community, Garmin Connect. Here, you can see your run on a map, get more detail on each mile, see a daily summary of your activities and share with friends. You can also join online challenges and earn virtual badges for extra motivation.Physical dimensions - 1.79” x 2.25” x 0.62” (45.5 x 57.2 x 15.7 mm)Display size, WxH - 0.98” x 0.94” (25 x 24 mm)Display resolution, WxH - 52 x 32 pixelsWeight - Large: 43 g (1.5 oz)Features Include:- Tracks distance pace calories and heart rate- Heart Rate Monitor/strap (HRM) included- Activity tracking counts steps and calories and reminds you when it’s time to move- Compatible with foot pod for recording distance indoors- Up to 8 hours of battery life with GPS on or 5 weeks in watch/activity tracking mode- Save plan and share your activities at Garmin Connect™- Virtual Pacer™ (compares current pace to target)- Personal records- Auto Pause® (pauses and resumes timer based on speed)- Auto Lap® (automatically starts a new lap)- Heart rate-based calorie computation- Calculates calories burned- Customizable screen(s)- Shock Resistant- Step counter- Auto goal (learns your activity level and assigns a daily step goal)- Move bar (displays on device after a period of inactivity; walk for a couple of minutes to reset it)- Sleep monitoring (monitors total sleep and periods of movement or restful sleep)IN THE BOX YOU WILL FIND:- Forerunner 15- Heart rate monitor- Charging/data cable- Manual\n                                \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":78,"row":{"pair_id":"724975#13808496","label":0,"id_left":724975,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":790009,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Alpina Automatic 4 Watch AL-525SS5AQ6\" \"Shop Alpina AL-525BS5AQ6B | Moyer Fine Jewelers\"","description_left":"\"<p>An elegant watch will always deliver sophistication and style- and this timepiece from Alpina brings you just that. This Gents’ watch can surely be an awe-striking piece once you lay eyes upon it. With a Rotating (diver time) bezel, this treasure represents thorough craftsmanship. The Stainless steel case that encloses this piece’s mechanism is also evidence of the quality that comes from this stylish item. The contrasting Silver dial color adds a bold sense of luxury. Also important to note is the Scratch resistant sapphire crystal that protects the dial. With additional Central 60 second hand, Date complications to spice up this already brillliant timepiece, you’ll surely bring home a winner if you get yourself one of these beauties. The numbers in the face of the dial are in Indexes. It is also water resistant for 330 ft (100 meter). </p>\n<p>This watch is just one of the many impressive pieces we have in store for you. Moyer Fine Jewelers is an authorized dealer of Alpina. We are available to answer your questions and look forward to hearing from you soon. </p>\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":13808496,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":13102771,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Communion 01 Size 4 SS\"@en-US \"Rosary Centers : All Materials -- The Rosary Shop\"@en-US","description_right":"\"An attractive communion center. Available in silver plate, gold plate, sterling,...\"@en-US ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":79,"row":{"pair_id":"2826196#10895580","label":0,"id_left":2826196,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":1066720,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Ball Men's Engineer Hydrocarbon Airborne Chronometer Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (DM2076C-S1CAJ-BK) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"Fantastic Gents Ball Engineer Hydrocarbon Airborne Chronometer, featuring Ball's famous hallmark of 31 micro gas tubes on the hands and dial, giving unbeatable low light visibility. This is displayed on a black dial with day and date function. This is powered by a COSC certified Swiss automatic movement with Chronometer standard timing, with Ball's patented SpringLOCK anti-shock system. The movement is housed inside the fantastic solid stainless steel case, with patented crown protection system. The case is water resistant to 12 atmospheres, and has a unidirectional rotating ceramic bezel with superluminova inserts, and sapphire crystal. The watch has a selection of either a tapered stainless steel bracelet with push button deployment buckle, or a black rubber strap.\"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":10895580,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":959200,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Ball Men's Engineer Hydrocarbon Ceramic XV Chronometer Automatic Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (DM2136A-SCJ-BK) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_right":"\"Solid gent's Ball Engineer Hydrocarbon Ceramic XV Chronometer, featuring a COSC certified automatic movement, finished to the highest levels of accuracy attainable by a mechanical movement, also featuring a date function. The movement is housed in a solid stainless steel case, water resistant to 30atm, with a screw down case back, crown with Ball's patented crown locking and protection system. To complete the tough credentials of the case, the watch has a scratch resistant ceramic bezel, with luminous inserts, and a scratch resistant, anti reflective sapphire crystal. The watch fastens on a heavy duty stainless steel bracelet, with hidden deployment clasp. For ultimate visibility, this watch is fitted with luminous gas light tubes, so low light visibilty is astonishing, and never fades or requires recharging.\"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":80,"row":{"pair_id":"3947592#5870407","label":1,"id_left":3947592,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":3957571,"brand_left":"\"Cartier\"","title_left":" \"Cartier Roadster W62041V3\" W62041V3 Watch | Watchfinder & Co.\"","description_left":"\"This Cartier has undergone a thorough inspection of accuracy, functionality and condition at our Cartier certified service centre to determine the level of reconditioning required to meet our strict standards. It has also been checked against our records to ensure authenticity.\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":5870407,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":3957571,"brand_right":"\"Cartier\"","title_right":" \"Cartier\" \"CartierCartier Roadster Series Men's Watch W62041V3\"","description_right":" \"See a beautiful diamond watch or jewelry on our site you'd like to buy but just don't have all the money right now? We can help by offering you FREE layaway plan. Just give us toll-free call 1-877-577-TIME send an email sales@icedtime.com and we'll be glad take your order\"","price_right":"\"$\", \"$5,445.00\"","specTableContent_right":" Item spec Gender Mens Case Material Stainless Steel Dial Color Black Bracelet Stainless Steel, Calfskin Leather Clasp Hidden Folding Clasp Movement Automatic Bezel Fixed Crystal Scratch Resistant Sapphire Case Back Solid Water Resistant 100m/330ft Case Diameter 44mm x 37mm Case Thickness 10.2mm General Item # W62041V3 MSRP $6,050.00 Brand Cartier"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":81,"row":{"pair_id":"7776738#9044836","label":1,"id_left":7776738,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":11245826,"brand_left":"\"Cartier\"","title_left":" \"Cartier\" \"CartierCartier New Santos Series Men's Watch W20090 x 8\"","description_left":" \"See a beautiful diamond watch or jewelry on our site you'd like to buy but just don't have all the money right now? We can help by offering you FREE layaway plan. Just give us toll-free call 1-877-577-TIME send an email sales@icedtime.com and we'll be glad take your order\"","price_left":"\"$\", \"$7,920.00\"","specTableContent_left":" Item spec Gender Mens Case Material Stainless Steel Dial Color Silver Bracelet Black Leather Clasp Deployant Clasp Movement Automatic Chronograph Bezel Fixed Crystal Scratch Resistant Sapphire Case Back Solid Water Resistant 30m/100ft Case Diameter 38mm x 38mm Case Thickness 10.5mm General Item # W20090 x 8 MSRP $8,800.00 Brand Cartier","id_right":9044836,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":11245826,"brand_right":"\"Cartier\"","title_right":" \"Cartier Santos 100 W20090X8\" W20090X8 Watch | Watchfinder & Co.\"","description_right":"\"This Cartier has undergone a thorough inspection of accuracy, functionality and condition at our Cartier certified service centre to determine the level of reconditioning required to meet our strict standards. It has also been checked against our records to ensure authenticity.\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":82,"row":{"pair_id":"9169175#17475","label":0,"id_left":9169175,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":4968146,"brand_left":"\"Cartier\"","title_left":" \"Cartier Must 21 W10125U2\" W10125U2 Watch | Watchfinder & Co.\"","description_left":"\"\n                            Cartier has been in business ever since Louis-François Cartier took over the Paris workshop of his mentor Adolphe Picard in 1847. Since then, the name Cartier has become synonymous with quality, luxury and grace. Known as one of the foremost purveyors of ultra-elegant jewellery, Cartier has long made superb watches as well—many with excellent mechanical pedigree. The company's glamorous reputation is justified by every model, crafted with a unique and unrivalled stylishness that continues to make it one of the most highly sought brands in the world. The superb Must 21 series is no exception, as seen in this model's stunning oversized bezel an dial patterned with the Cartier logo.\n                            \n                        \", \"This Cartier has undergone a thorough inspection of accuracy, functionality and condition at our Cartier certified service centre to determine the level of reconditioning required to meet our strict standards. It has also been checked against our records to ensure authenticity.\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":" Name Monthly Repayment Total Amount Cost of Credit APR Interest Free Finance (6 Months) £225.63 £1,805.00 £0.00 0% Interest Free Finance (12 Months) £112.81 £1,805.00 £0.00 0% Classic Credit 24 Months 9.9% £62.15 £1,942.85 £137.85 9.9% Classic Credit 36 Months 9.9% £43.35 £2,011.85 £206.85 9.9% Classic Credit 48 Months 9.9% £34.01 £2,083.73 £278.73 9.9%","id_right":17475,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":11122751,"brand_right":"\"Cartier\"","title_right":" \"Cartier Santos W20018D6\" W20018D6 Watch | Watchfinder & Co.\"","description_right":"\"This Cartier has undergone a thorough inspection of accuracy, functionality and condition at our Cartier certified service centre to determine the level of reconditioning required to meet our strict standards. It has also been checked against our records to ensure authenticity.\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":83,"row":{"pair_id":"3102673#7442419","label":1,"id_left":3102673,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":190840,"brand_left":"\"Junghans\"@de","title_left":" \"Meister Pilot Automatikuhr\"@de 00 €\"@de \"Junghans Meister Automatikuhr 027/3591.00 nur 2.240","description_left":"\"\n\t\t\t\t\tArtikel-Nr.: 3538 027/3591.00\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tSportlich-elegante Herren-AutomatikuhrDie Automatikuhr ist eine mechanische Armbanduhr, bei der die Feder bei Armbewegungen des Trägers durch einen Rotor in kleinen Schritten aufgezogen wird.\nDer Rotor, der zumeist kugelgelagert ist, bleibt bei Bewegungen des Uhrgehäuses aufgrund seiner Massenträgheit und der Schwerkraft im Raum stehen, wobei ein Drehmoment auf den Aufziehmechanismus ausgeübt wird. Im Normalfall wird die Feder in beide Drehrichtungen aufgezogen. Liegt die Drehbewegung des Gehäuses in der Achse des Rotors, so beruht das Prinzip allein auf dem Trägheitsmoment des Rotors. Dieses Phänomen funktioniert also auch in der Schwerelosigkeit. Bei Drehbewegungen, die senkrecht zur Achse des Rotors stattfinden, kommt die Exzentrizität desselben zum Tragen: Der Rotor ist zumeist nur halbkreisförmig ausgebildet, so dass sein Schwerpunkt nicht mit seiner Achse zusammenfällt. Wird die Uhr nur leicht aus der Horizontalen gedreht, genügt dies gegebenenfalls für eine 180-Grad-Drehung des Rotors. Eine Rutschkupplung verhindert ein Überdrehen der Zugfeder, wenn die Uhr bereits voll aufgezogen ist. Automatikuhren zeichnen sich neben ihrer einfachen Handhabung auch durch einen erheblich gleichmäßigeren Lauf aus, der durch die stets gleichmäßig gespannte Feder ausgelöst wird.  Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon der Marke Junghans.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDas Gehäuse ist aus hochwertigem Edelstahl gefertigt und hat eine fein gebürstete Oberfläche.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tAuf dem schwarzen Zifferblatt befindet sich ein Junghans Schriftzug.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDie Zeiger sind aus Edelstahl gefertigt. Die IndizesIndizes ist das deutsche Wort für das lateinische Index. Spricht man von Indizes, dann sind die Zahlen die die Zeit anzeigen (bei vielen Uhren z.B. arabische Zahlen: 3, 6, 9, 12, aber auch z.B. römische Zahlen: III, VI, IX, XII) oder stattdessen die Platzhalter dafür gemeint. Platzhalter können je nach Gestaltung der Uhr die Unterschiedlichsten Formen haben. Uhrenindexe werden oft nicht nur aufgemalt sondern auch aufgesetzt – bei exklusiven Uhren auch veredelt (mit z.B. Gold, Rosegold, Silber, Chrom). Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon und Zeiger sind zudem mit einer umweltfreundlichen Leuchtmasse beschichtet.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDie Uhr verfügt über eine Stopp-Funktion, diese wird über die DrückerDas ist der Teil, mit dem sich eine Funktion der Uhr steuern lässt, bei Savonnettes z. B. das Öffnen des Sprungdeckels, bei Chronographen das Starten, Stoppen und Nullstellen, bei Weltzeituhren das Verstellen der Zonenzeiten. Er befindet sich meist neben der Krone am Gehäuserand.  Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon am Gehäuserand bedient.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tAuf dem Zifferblattrand befindet sich eine vollständige MinuterieAuf dem Zifferblatt umlaufende Einteilung der Minuten, oft zwischen zwei Kreise eingefaßt (‘Eisenbahnminuterie = sieht aus wie Eisenbahnschienen) und teilweise mit ‘5’-Minutenzahlen versehen. Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDas gewölbte und beidseitig entspiegelte SaphirglasSaphirglas (Al2O3) ist von den üblichen Uhrengläsern das härteste. Lediglich der Diamant und einige Karbide weisen eine größere Härte auf und können Kratzer auf einem Saphirglas verursachen. Da Saphirglas relativ stark spiegelt, wird es häufig mit einer Beschichtung versehen (sog. 'Antireflex-Saphir'), die dann leider nicht dieselbe Widerstandsfähigkeit aufweist. Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon schützt die Uhr vor äußeren Einflüssen.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDie zwölfeckige, drehbare LünetteDie Lünette ist Bestandteil des Uhrengehäuses. Es handelt sich dabei um einen Ring mit Nut, der auf das Gehäuse einer tragbaren Uhr montiert ist. Dieser Ring ist entweder fest verschraubt oder drehbar und eignet sich dann als Anzeige bestimmter Werte (Himmelsrichtung, zweite Zeitzone, Geschwindigkeitsmesser.)\n Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon ist ebenfalls aus hochwertigem Edelstahl gefertigt und ist mit einer Minutenskalierung versehen.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDie Uhr wird durch ein präzises Automatikwerk KaliberDas Kaliber beschreibt die Form und die Größe eines Uhrwerks. Die Kalibernummer steht für den Werkstyp einer Uhr. ETA beispielsweise ist einer der größten Schweizer Anbieter mechanischer Werke. Anhand der Nummer kann ein Uhrenmacher im Bedarfsfall die passenden Ersatzteile für einen bestimmte Uhr bestimmen. Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon J880.4 angetrieben.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDas Gehäuse hat einen Durchmesser von ca. 43.3 mm, die Höhe beträgt ca. 14.4 mm.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDas Band ist aus hochwertigem Rindsleder mit Vernietung gefertigt und verspricht einen hohen Tragekomfort.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDas Lederband wird mit einer DornschließeEine Dornschließe beschreibt die Verschlussart einer Uhr.  In dem längeren Armbandteil werden löcher gestanzt. Auf der anderen Seite befindet sich die Dornschließe, welche aus einem Dorn und einem Metallbügel in U-Form, diese verhindert, dass der Dorn aus dem Loch rutscht.\nDornschließen sind an diversen Materialien zu finden und erstrecken sich in alle Preisklasse. Häufig findet man Dornschließen bei Lederarmbändern oder Textilarmbändern.\n\n Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon aus Edelstahl verschlossen.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t100 Tage Niedrigpreisgarantie, bei uhrzeit.org kaufen Sie ohne Preisrisiko!\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tFür unsere Waren bestehen die gesetzlichen Gewährleistungsrechte\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tInformationen zu AutomatikuhrenWas sind eigentlich Automatikuhren?Automatikuhren sind Uhren, welche ein mechanisches Uhrwerk aufweisen und von einem Rotor angetrieben werden. Dieser wird  durch Bewegungen vom Arm bzw. Handgelenk  zum Rotieren gebracht  um die Hauptantriebsfeder aufzuziehen.  Aufgrund dessen wird laufend Energie hergestellt, so dass eine Batterie überflüssig wird. Die Gangabweichungen einer Uhr variieren je nach Fertigung, Kalibrierung beim Hersteller, Lebensstil, sowie Tragegewohnheit des Trägers. Die meisten Automatikuhren haben eine Gangabweichung von -20/+30 Sekunden am Tag.  Dies muss leider akzeptiert werden. Sofern eine höhere Ganggenauigkeit gewünscht ist, sind Uhren mit Chronometerprüfung  eine gute Wahl.  Hier erhalten die Uhren das Bewertungszertifikat COSC, für welches sie im Vorfeld diverse Tests bestehen müssen – erst dann dürfen sie sich als Chronometer bezeichnen. Die Ganggenauigkeit darf maximal -4/+6 Sekunden Abweichung am Tag aufweisen und ist ca. 20 Mal genauer als eine normale Automatikuhr. Um der Ganggenauigkeit positiv entgegen zu wirken spielen die Tragegewohnheiten des Trägers eine große Rolle, denn ein aktiver Uhrenträger kann sich über eine genauere Uhr freuen als ein „passiver“ Uhrenträger.Neben der Ganggenauigkeit spielt auch die Gangreserve eine zentrale Rolle bei Automatikuhren. Die Gangreserve, auch Gangautonomie genannt, bezeichnet die Zeitdauer, in der das Uhrwerk weiterläuft, nachdem sie das letzte Mal bewegt wurde. Hier variiert die Stundenanzahl sehr stark und liegt je nach Uhr zwischen 32 und 60 Stunden.Die Langlebigkeit einer Automatikuhr  kann durch das Verhindern von starken Temperaturschwankungen, unnötigen Stößen, Luftdruckschwankungen und Wasserdruck, sowie das häufige Tragen einer Uhr erheblich verbessert werden. Dies wirkt sich auf alle Teile, insbesondere auf das Uhrwerk, sehr positiv aus.Ein großer Vorteil von Automatikuhren ist, dass sie ohne Batterien auskommen. Des Weiteren entfällt das manuelle Aufziehen der Triebfeder. Somit wird eine lange Haltbarkeit einer Automatikuhr gewährleistet. Das Uhrwerk sollte nach 2-5 Jahren ggf. überholt werden, um die Haltbarkeit weiter sicherzustellen.Zu guter Letzt ist es wichtig zu wissen,  wo der Unterschied zwischen Quarz- und Automatikuhren liegt. Quarzuhren sind im Handel in analoger und digitaler Ausführung erhältlich.  Sie sind elektromechanische oder auch vollelektronische Uhren deren Taktgeber ein elektronischer Oszillator ist. Daher ziehen sie ihre Energie meist aus einer Batterie oder aus Knopfzellen. Einige wenige Ausnahmen gibt es, in denen mechanische Energie über einen Mechanismus  in elektrische Ladung umgewandelt und in Akkus gespeichert wird. Dies ist beispielsweise bei der Linie Seiko Kinetic der Fall. Quarzuhren werden meist als Echtzeituhren bezeichnet. Hieraus lässt sich schließen, dass eine Quarzuhr im Gegensatz zu einer Automatikuhr hinsichtlich der Genauigkeit ganz klar die Nase vorn hat und ohne Bewegung der Uhr absolute Genauigkeit aufweist.Automatikuhren sind besonders interessant für Uhrenkenner. Einen Blickfang stellt der flüssig laufende Sekundenzeiger dar. Häufig sind die Uhren mit einem Glasboden versehen, der einen Blick auf das Uhrwerk und den sich bewegenden Rotor zulässt. Die Faszination der Mechanik einer Uhr liegt ganz klar bei Automatikuhr en!\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\"@de ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":7442419,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":190840,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Junghans Men's Meister Pilot Automatic Chronograph Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (027/3591.00) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_right":"\"The high demands placed on timekeeping by aviation were first addressed by Junghans in the 1930s, when the company produced on-board clocks for air traffic use.\n\nThese were manufactured in level 7 of the now heritage-listed terrace building, the structure offered optimal lighting conditions for the delicate task of watchmaking. The classic instrument appearance of the cockpit was also reflected in the legendary Bundeswehr chronograph of 1955. The design of the Meister Pilot harks back to this: on the bi-directional rotating bezel the 12 distinctive, concave notches ensure a good grip as well as the unmistakable appearance of the timepiece. The screwed case back features a distinctive element: a specially-designed compass rose, which incorporates the symbolism of classic aviation in the form of an artificial horizon. The riveted leather strap ensures a secure fit on the wrist. The particular construction of the front assembly lends the timepiece an unusual elegance for a pilot watch – and the lightness required for take-off.\"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":84,"row":{"pair_id":"4820505#2273071","label":0,"id_left":4820505,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":712172,"brand_left":"\"Junghans\"@en","title_left":" \"Max Bill Ladies´ Watch\"@en \"Junghans Max Watch 047/4659.00 nur € 495.00\"@en","description_left":null,"price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":2273071,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":635138,"brand_right":"\"Junghans\"@en","title_right":" \"Automatic watch Max Bill\"@en \"Junghans Automatic Bill 027/4700.00 nur € 925.00\"@en","description_right":null,"price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":" General Target Group: Mens Case housing diameter: 38 mm Shape: Round glass: Synthetic crystal Material: Stainless steel"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":85,"row":{"pair_id":"17557491#10272884","label":0,"id_left":17557491,"category_left":"Luggage_and_Travel_Gear","cluster_id_left":1719439,"brand_left":"\"TomTom\"@en","title_left":" \"TomTom Multi-Sport Cardio CSS+AM GPS Watch - Heart Rate Monitors & Sport Watches Grey\"@en","description_left":null,"price_left":"\"EUR\"@en, \"383.95\"@en","specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":10272884,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":1452348,"brand_right":"\"Garmin\"@en-US","title_right":" \"Garmin Forerunner 225 GPS Running Watch with Wrist-based Heart Rate\"@en-US \"Running Units | Fitness Gear Express\"@en-US","description_right":"\"Know your zone with Forerunner 225 - the first Garmin GPS running watch with wrist-based heart rate. Now you have the option to run without a strap because this watch has a built-in sensor that measures heart rate at the wrist. A colorful gauge shows your zone and beats per minute at a glance: warm-up (gray), easy (blue), aerobic (green), threshold (orange) or maximum (red). Create customized workouts or download free training plans at Garmin Connect, send to your watch and get coach-like guidance. The 225 offers vibration alerts and a built-in accelerometer to record distance for treadmill workouts. Connected features include automatic uploads to Garmin Connect, live tracking and social media sharing.\"@en-US ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":86,"row":{"pair_id":"2814747#5253701","label":0,"id_left":2814747,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":350944,"brand_left":"\"Casio\"@en","title_left":" \"G-Shock Men´s Watch\"@en \"Casio G-Shock Watch GA-800-4AER nur € 129.00\"@en","description_left":null,"price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":" General Target Group: Mens Case housing diameter: 54 mm housing height: 15 mm Shape: Round housing color: Red glass: Mineral crystal Material: Synthetic","id_right":5253701,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":12784758,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Morellato Gents Watch Analogue Quartz, Steel and Pink Steel, Rose Bezel, Bracelet\"@en Bracelet | Samuels Jewelers\"@en Bezel Quartz","description_right":"\"Morellato Gents Watch Analogue Quartz, Steel and Pink Steel, Rose Bezel, Steel Bracelet\"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":87,"row":{"pair_id":"15045977#1743996","label":0,"id_left":15045977,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":547135,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Tissot Men's PRC200 Automatic Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (T0554301105700) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"This handsome men's Tissot Prc200 watch is made from stainless steel and is powered by an automatic movement. It is fastened with a silver metal  bracelet and has a grey dial.  The watch has a date function. \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":1743996,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":679144,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Tissot Men's Classic Dream Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (T0334102205301) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_right":"\"Mens Tissot Classic Dream watch in a stylish two-tone design in steel and gold plate. The black dial has a date function and elegant Roman numeral hour markers.\"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":88,"row":{"pair_id":"17557314#14901993","label":0,"id_left":17557314,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":15748134,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Longines Master Collection Watch L2.628.4.51.7\" \"Shop Longines L2.128.4.57.6 Watches | Northeastern Fine Jewelry\"","description_left":"\"<p>This exceptional timepiece, model number L2.628.4.51.7 from Longines provides elegance and high tech functionality for your everyday fashion. This Gents timepiece expresses a flawless and sophisticated character. </p>\n\n<p> \nThis is the watch of enormous functionality and distinct style. A black dial was decorated to the highest standards in watchmaking. Its automatic (self winding) movement offers excellence in technical innovation. This watch includes central 60 second hand, date complications. Its complications greatly increase your watch’s functionality. The numbers on this timepiece are in roman numeral style, seamlessly fitting right in with the entire piece. The neat round case is 38 mm. The case is artfully created out of stainless steel, both eye catching and is crafted to last. The watch’s alligator band was designed to be worn all day and still be comfortable to wear. This watch's bezel features eye-catching stainless steel that speaks for itself. This bezel is one that will not be forgotten and will always be by your side. </p>\n\n<p>Northeastern Fine Jewelry has sleek, elegant, and luxurious watches for any price level. For more information, call 1-855-795-NEFJ or email at info@nefj.com.</p>\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":14901993,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":5631106,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Chopard Grand Prix De Monaco Watch 158569-3001\" 161275-5004 | Dejaun Jewelers\"","description_right":"\"<p> A luxury timepiece makes a brilliant statement of style. While most people think watches are simply a practical accessory, a fine timepiece can also add elegance to your look. At Dejaun Jewelers, we are delighted to offer diverse selection of some of the worldâ€™s finest luxury watch brands, including Chopard. We are also honored to be an authorized Chopard retailer in Los Angeles. Chopard's exquisite timepieces are built to last. This Gents watch with model number 158569-3001 is part of the unique Grand Prix De Monaco collection. It features a accurate Automatic (self winding) movement, Stainless steel band, and a Stainless steel bezel. The water resistance of this watch is 330 ft (100 meter).</p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":89,"row":{"pair_id":"2432392#6529903","label":1,"id_left":2432392,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":750167,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Ladies Raymond Weil Nabucco BRIT Awards 2014 Limited Edition Titanium Automatic Chronograph Diamond Watch 7700-TIR-BRIT14 \"Ladies Watches | Designer For Women The Hut\"","description_left":null,"price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":6529903,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":750167,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Ladies Raymond Weil Nabucco BRIT Awards 2014 Limited Edition Titanium Automatic Chronograph Diamond Watch 7700-TIR-BRIT14 \"Raymond Watches\"","description_right":null,"price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":90,"row":{"pair_id":"16746487#2140647","label":0,"id_left":16746487,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":4906621,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Michele Serein Watch MWW21A000008\" \"Shop Michele MWW21A000001 Watches | Northeastern Fine Jewelry\"","description_left":"\"<p>This fine watch, model number MWW21A000008 from Michele gives luxury and top notch functionality for the modern watch user. This Ladies timepiece features some of the most contemporary and useful features. </p>\n\n<p> \nThis is a timepiece of insurmountable functionality and unparalleled style. A white dial comes complete with intricate hour and minute markings that you’ll love. This watch includes small second hand, day, date, central 60 second hand complications. Its complications are representative of this jeweler’s unique expertise of watches that take advantage of all of the space in the dial. The numbers on this timepiece are in roman numeral style, seamlessly fitting right in with the entire piece. The clean round case is 40 mm. The case is finely created out of stainless steel, 18k yellow gold plated, both eye catching and was crafted to last a long time. The watch’s stainless steel, 18k yellow gold plated band is smooth and made out of the highest quality materials. This watch's bezel features eye-catching stainless steel that speaks volumes. This bezel is one that will not be forgotten and will always be found on your wrist. It encircles the scratch resistant sapphire crystal of the watch. It has a 150 ft (50 meter) water resistance. The true showstopper of this piece is the diamonds that are located in the bezel of this watch. </p>\n\n<p>Northeastern Fine Jewelry has a stunning selection of watches from the best watchmakers in the world. For more information, call 1-855-795-NEFJ or email at info@nefj.com.</p>\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":2140647,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":4906660,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Michele Serein Watch MWW21A000058\" \"Shop Michele MWW21A000001 Watches | Northeastern Fine Jewelry\"","description_right":"\"<p>This fine luxury timepiece, model number MWW21A000058 from Michele gives beauty and high tech functionality for watch lovers. This Ladies timepiece expresses a flawless and sophisticated character. </p>\n\n<p> \nThis is a watch of reliable functionality and indescribable style. A blue dial comes complete with intricate hour and minute markings that you’ll love. This watch includes central 60 second hand complications. Its complications are distinctively positioned for easy reading. The watch’s lizard band fits snugly and fashionably over your wrist. This watch's bezel features eye-catching stainless steel that speaks volumes. This bezel is one for the ages and will always be by your side. It encircles the scratch resistant sapphire crystal of the watch. It has a 150 ft (50 meter) water resistance. The true showstopper of this piece is the diamonds that are located in the bezel of this watch. </p>\n\n<p>Northeastern Fine Jewelry knows exactly what features watch lovers adore. For more information, call 1-855-795-NEFJ or email at info@nefj.com.</p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":91,"row":{"pair_id":"11618246#16389586","label":0,"id_left":11618246,"category_left":"Cellphones_and_Accessories","cluster_id_left":2953072,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Samsung - Gear S2 Classic Smartwatch 40mm Stainless Steel Black Leather\"@en-US","description_left":"\"Never miss a call or text with this Samsung Gear S2 Classic smartwatch, which features Wi-Fi, Bluetooth and NFC technologies for simple connection to the Web or your compatible Android,  iOS device.¹ Receive notifications and check your schedule, or stay active using S Health or Nike+ Running. The leather band offers a stylish look.\"@en-US ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":16389586,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":233762,"brand_right":"\"Daniel Wellington\"@es","title_right":" \"Classic Black Cornwall Oro Rosé 40mm\"@es \"Daniel Wellington Classic 40mm nur 159 00 €\"@es","description_right":null,"price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":92,"row":{"pair_id":"1183924#9058708","label":1,"id_left":1183924,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":209584,"brand_left":"\"Skagen\"@en","title_left":" \"Men´s Watch Hagen\"@en \"Skagen Men´s Hagen SKW6216 nur € 189.00\"@en","description_left":null,"price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":9058708,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":209584,"brand_right":"\"Skagen\"","title_right":" \"Skagen SKW6216 Hagen watch\"","description_right":"\"            \t                    This beautiful Skagen SKW6216 Hagen watch steals the show! This watch with its black stainless steel case is a real eye-catcher. The color of the dial is white. Additionally, this watch has a very strong mineral crystal. A Skagen watch shows that you want something different than the rest of the world and choose for design and comfort of a perfect quality watch. You receive 2 years warranty on the movement.            \t                    \n            \t                        Read more            \t                        Close            \t                        \n    \t                        \" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":93,"row":{"pair_id":"8062783#517008","label":0,"id_left":8062783,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":9941809,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Alpina Automatic 4 Watch AL-525BS5AQ6\" \"Shop Alpina AL-525BS5AQ6B | Moyer Fine Jewelers\"","description_left":"\"<p>An intricate watch will never fail to convey sophistication and style- and this timepiece from Alpina brings you just that. This Gents’ watch can definitely be an awe-striking piece once you lay eyes upon it. With a Rotating (diver time) bezel, this beauty represents delicate craftsmanship. The Stainless steel case that encloses this piece’s mechanism is also evidence of the quality that comes from this stylish item. The contrasting Black dial color adds a pronounced sense of luxury. Also important to note is the Scratch resistant sapphire crystal that protects the dial. With additional Central 60 second hand, Date complications to spice up this already brillliant timepiece, you’ll surely bring home a winner if you get yourself one of these beauties. The numbers in the face of the dial are in Indexes. It is also water resistant for 330 ft (100 meter). </p>\n<p>This watch is just one of the many impressive pieces we have in store for you. Moyer Fine Jewelers is an authorized dealer of Alpina. We are available to clarify any specifications and look forward to hearing from you soon. </p>\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":517008,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":2525642,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Cartier Drive De Cartier Watch WGNM0006\" \"Shop WGNM0008 Watches | Northeastern Fine Jewelry\"","description_right":"\"<p>This well crafted luxury watch, model number WGNM0006 from Cartier offers luxury and first-rate functionality for watch enthusiasts and average wearers alike. This Gents timepiece features some of the most contemporary and useful features. </p>\n\n<p> \nThis is a watch of numerous functionality and indescribable style. A silver dial was decorated to the highest standards in watchmaking. Its manual winding movement features complications you’ll come to cherish. Its complications are representative of this jeweler’s unique expertise of watches that take advantage of all of the space in the dial. The numbers on this timepiece are in roman numeral style, seamlessly fitting right in with the entire piece. The case is artfully crafted of 18k pink gold, both aesthetically pleasing and was crafted to last a long time. The watch’s alligator band was designed to be worn all day and still be comfortable to wear. This watch's bezel features eye-catching 18k pink gold that speaks volumes. This bezel is one that will not be forgotten and is the perfect place to keep in fashion and keep time. It encircles the scratch resistant sapphire crystal of the watch. It has a 100 ft (30 meter) water resistance. </p>\n\n<p>Northeastern Fine Jewelry has everything from simple timepieces to ones you’ll want to keep in the family forever. For more information, call 1-855-795-NEFJ or email at info@nefj.com.</p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":94,"row":{"pair_id":"9607759#653194","label":1,"id_left":9607759,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":986795,"brand_left":"\"Cartier\"","title_left":" \"Cartier Santos W20098D6\" W20098D6 Watch | Watchfinder & Co.\"","description_left":"\"\n                            It was in 1904 that Louis Cartier gave a watch to his good friend and aviation pioneer Alberto Santos-Dumont that was designed to be worn on the wrist. The Santos watch was the first ever men's wristwatch, originally invented to make it easier to check the time while flying. It was a game-changer in the industry thanks to Santos-Dumont's huge popularity and fame, as well as a very early example of the iconic Art Deco style that would influence fashion and watchmaking for decades. The modern Santos watches maintain the classic hallmarks of the original, including the rounded square case, Roman numerals and fully incorporated lugs. \n                            \n                        \", \"This Cartier has undergone a thorough inspection of accuracy, functionality and condition at our Cartier certified service centre to determine the level of reconditioning required to meet our strict standards. It has also been checked against our records to ensure authenticity.\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":653194,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":986795,"brand_right":"\"Cartier\"","title_right":" \"Cartier\" \"CartierCartier Classic Santos Series Men's Watch W20098D6\"","description_right":" \"See a beautiful diamond watch or jewelry on our site you'd like to buy but just don't have all the money right now? We can help by offering you FREE layaway plan. Just give us toll-free call 1-877-577-TIME send an email sales@icedtime.com and we'll be glad take your order\"","price_right":"\"$\", \"$4,635.00\"","specTableContent_right":" Item spec Gender Mens Case Material Stainless Steel Dial Color Silver Bracelet Stainless Steel Clasp Hidden Folding Clasp Movement Automatic Bezel Fixed Crystal Scratch Resistant Sapphire Case Back Solid Water Resistant 30m/100ft Case Diameter 32mm x 33mm Case Thickness 8.3mm General Item # W20098D6 MSRP $5,150.00 Brand Cartier"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":95,"row":{"pair_id":"2891465#5487545","label":0,"id_left":2891465,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":340325,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Alpina Pilot Quartz Chronograph Watch AL-372BGR4S6\" \"Shop Alpina AL-372LBBG4FBV6 | Moyer Fine Jewelers\"","description_left":"\"<p>An elegant timepiece will always convey sophistication and style- and this timepiece from Alpina brings you just that. This Gents’ watch can surely be an awe-striking piece once you lay eyes upon it. With a Polished bezel, this beauty represents thorough craftsmanship. The Stainless steel case that encloses this piece’s mechanism is also evidence of the quality that comes from this stylish item. The contrasting Gray dial color adds a pronounced sense of luxury. Also important to note is the Scratch resistant sapphire crystal that protects the dial. With additional Central 60 second hand, Chronograph, Date, Small second hand complications to spice up this already brillliant timepiece, you’ll surely bring home a winner if you get yourself one of these beauties. </p>\n<p>This chic and classy watch from Alpina has a Pin buckle clasp type and sports a Quartz (battery) movement. The numbers in the face of the dial are in Indexes. This watch also comes with a 2 years international warranty. It is also water resistant for 330 ft (100 meter). </p>\n<p>This watch is just one of the many impressive pieces we have in store for you. Moyer Fine Jewelers is an authorized dealer of Alpina. We are available to answer your questions and look forward to hearing from you soon. </p>\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":5487545,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":3277105,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Alpina Pilot Quartz Chronograph Watch AL-372LBBG4FBV6\" \"Shop Alpina AL-372LBBG4FBV6 | Moyer Fine Jewelers\"","description_right":"\"Null\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":96,"row":{"pair_id":"17557314#17557369","label":1,"id_left":17557314,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":15748134,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Longines Master Collection Watch L2.628.4.51.7\" \"Shop Longines L2.128.4.57.6 Watches | Northeastern Fine Jewelry\"","description_left":"\"<p>This exceptional timepiece, model number L2.628.4.51.7 from Longines provides elegance and high tech functionality for your everyday fashion. This Gents timepiece expresses a flawless and sophisticated character. </p>\n\n<p> \nThis is the watch of enormous functionality and distinct style. A black dial was decorated to the highest standards in watchmaking. Its automatic (self winding) movement offers excellence in technical innovation. This watch includes central 60 second hand, date complications. Its complications greatly increase your watch’s functionality. The numbers on this timepiece are in roman numeral style, seamlessly fitting right in with the entire piece. The neat round case is 38 mm. The case is artfully created out of stainless steel, both eye catching and is crafted to last. The watch’s alligator band was designed to be worn all day and still be comfortable to wear. This watch's bezel features eye-catching stainless steel that speaks for itself. This bezel is one that will not be forgotten and will always be by your side. </p>\n\n<p>Northeastern Fine Jewelry has sleek, elegant, and luxurious watches for any price level. For more information, call 1-855-795-NEFJ or email at info@nefj.com.</p>\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":17557369,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":15748134,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Longines Master Collection L2.628.4.51.7\" \"Shop Longines at Merry Richards\"","description_right":"\"<p>Who says you can’t have functionality and style all in one piece? This timepiece from Longines is out to prove just that. The body of the watch is a Stainless steel case material. While its soul, the mechanism, is of Automatic (self winding) movement. The timepiece is enclosed in a 38-mm case .  The case is Polished bezel type which gives the piece a definitive craftsmanship. The watch’s face is decked with a Black dial that not only matches but highlights the piece, as a whole. Features such as Date, Central 60 second hand as added complications make this piece more functional than ordinary. Now surely your watch won’t only tell time, it will also tell of your endearing sense for fashion and functionality.</p>\n\n<p>Merry Richards is an authorized and trustworthy distributor of Longines’s <product_type>. You can do business with us by calling at 630-516-8000. We can also be reached through this email address: scott@merryrichardsjewelers.com.</p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":97,"row":{"pair_id":"17557259#12372694","label":0,"id_left":17557259,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":872554,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Michele Serein Mid Watch MWW21B000009\" \"Shop Michele MW21B01B4099_MS16DH267715 Watches | Northeastern Fine Jewelry\"","description_left":"\"<p>This hand-crafted watch, model number MWW21B000009 from Michele gives beauty and high tech functionality for watch lovers. This Ladies timepiece only hints at the fine watchmaking within this timepiece. </p>\n\n<p> \nThis is the timepiece of insurmountable functionality and exquisite style. A white dial provides an elegant contrast to the bold and captivating numbers. Its quartz (battery) movement is as intricately crafted as the exterior. This watch includes central 60 second hand, date complications. Its complications are representative of this jeweler’s unique expertise of watches that take advantage of all of the space in the dial. The numbers on this timepiece are in roman numeral style, seamlessly fitting right in with the entire piece. The clean round case is 36 mm. The case is artfully crafted of stainless steel, both attention grabbing and is crafted to last. The watch’s stainless steel band is smooth and made out of the highest quality materials. This watch's bezel features eye-catching stainless steel that speaks for itself. This bezel is one for the ages and will always be found on your wrist. It encloses the scratch resistant sapphire crystal of the watch. It has a 150 ft (50 meter) water resistance. The true highlight of this piece is the diamonds that are located in the dial of this watch. </p>\n\n<p>Northeastern Fine Jewelry has a stunning selection of watches from the best watchmakers in the world. For more information, call 1-855-795-NEFJ or email at info@nefj.com.</p>\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":12372694,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":768940,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Michele Serein Watch MWW21A000001\" \"Shop Michele MW21A01B0966_MS18EV246710 Watches | Costello Jewelry Company\"","description_right":"\"<p> At Naperville’s most popular jewelry destination we offer a comprehensive selection of luxury watches.We are delighted to be a Michele retailer. As an authorized retailer, you can rest assured that every Michele watch we carry is 100% authentic and backed by a generous warranty.  Michele watches are crafted for comfort and they are sought after for their attention-getting styles. This MWW21A000001 Stainless steel Ladies Michele watch features a Scratch resistant sapphire crystal for worry-free wear. Whether you are looking for a watch that is stylish and sophisticated or casual and sporty we are confident that you’ll find just what you are looking for. </p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":98,"row":{"pair_id":"12616151#2960758","label":0,"id_left":12616151,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":109161,"brand_left":"\"Daniel Wellington\"@de","title_left":" \"Glasgow Rosegold Herrenuhr 40mm\"@de \"Daniel Wellington Glasgow 40mm nur 119 00 €\"@de","description_left":"\"\n\t\t\t\t\tArtikel-Nr.: 1623 DW00100004\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tElegant-moderne Herrenuhr der Marke Daniel Wellington.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDie Oberfläche ist poliert und hat eine rosé-goldfarbene IP Beschichtung.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tGehäuse, Zeiger und IndizesIndizes ist das deutsche Wort für das lateinische Index. Spricht man von Indizes, dann sind die Zahlen die die Zeit anzeigen (bei vielen Uhren z.B. arabische Zahlen: 3, 6, 9, 12, aber auch z.B. römische Zahlen: III, VI, IX, XII) oder stattdessen die Platzhalter dafür gemeint. Platzhalter können je nach Gestaltung der Uhr die Unterschiedlichsten Formen haben. Uhrenindexe werden oft nicht nur aufgemalt sondern auch aufgesetzt – bei exklusiven Uhren auch veredelt (mit z.B. Gold, Rosegold, Silber, Chrom). Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon sind aus hochwertigen Edelstahl hergestellt und rosé-goldfarben beschichtet.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tAuf dem Zifferblatt befindet sich ein Daniel Wellington Schriftzug mit Logo.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDas Mineralglas schützt die Uhr vor äußeren Einflüssen.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDer Gehäusedurchmesser beträgt ca. 40 mm und hat eine Höhe von ca. 6 mm.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDas hochwertige Natotextilarmband gewährt einen angenehmen Tragekomfort.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDas Band wird mit einer DornschließeEine Dornschließe beschreibt die Verschlussart einer Uhr.  In dem längeren Armbandteil werden löcher gestanzt. Auf der anderen Seite befindet sich die Dornschließe, welche aus einem Dorn und einem Metallbügel in U-Form, diese verhindert, dass der Dorn aus dem Loch rutscht.\nDornschließen sind an diversen Materialien zu finden und erstrecken sich in alle Preisklasse. Häufig findet man Dornschließen bei Lederarmbändern oder Textilarmbändern.\n\n Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon, auf welcher zusätzlich das Logo graviert ist, verschlossen.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t100 Tage Niedrigpreisgarantie, bei uhrzeit.org kaufen Sie ohne Preisrisiko!\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tFür unsere Waren bestehen die gesetzlichen Gewährleistungsrechte\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\"@de ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":2960758,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":1005006,"brand_right":"\"Daniel Wellington\"@en","title_right":" \"Glasgow Silver Men´s Watch 40mm\"@en \"Daniel Wellington Glasgow 40mm nur € 159.00\"@en","description_right":null,"price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":99,"row":{"pair_id":"10825967#17557319","label":1,"id_left":10825967,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":13207759,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Hamilton Jazzmaster Chrono Quartz Watch H32612555\"","description_left":"\"\n                             A exquisite watch is more than just useful for telling time, it is also a striking piece of fine jewelry. This Gents Hamilton H32612555 watch is from the ever popular Chrono Quartz collection. It features a accurate Quartz (battery) movement. Some other benefits of this watch are that it is water resistant up to 330 ft (100 meter) and includes a Scratch resistant sapphire crystal. \n Are you looking for an exceptional gift? This luxury timepiece is a thoughtful way to commemorate any occasion. Safa Jewelers is proud to be an authorized Hamilton retailer, so you can exquisite timepieces are built to endure and will be loved for years to come.                         \" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":17557319,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":13207759,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Hamilton Chrono Quartz H32612555\" \"Chrono Quartz\"","description_right":"\"<p> Metals in Time of Royal Oak, MI is known for having a vast selection of striking luxury timepieces, from the most beloved watch brands. We offer only supreme quality timepieces and we provide excellent service to go along with it. There is nothing quite as lovely as owning a well-made watch. It makes a stunning statement and is as fashionable as it is practical. We know that timepieces come with a variety of features and functions and our knowledgeable staff will help you navigate through our inventory to find the perfect timepiece to fit your needs. </p>\n<p> This H32612555 Hamilton watch is from the exquisite Chrono Quartz collection. Hamilton fine timepieces are both functional and stylish. This H32612555 Leather Gents Hamilton timepiece includes a resilient Scratch resistant sapphire crystal for worry-free wear. Whether you are looking  for a stylish or casual  watch, we have just what you want. Shop with confidence knowing Metals in Time is an authorized Hamilton dealer. </p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]}],"num_rows_total":1100,"num_rows_per_page":100,"partial":false}